msgid ""
"The product availability indicates whether a product can be downloaded "
"immediately (*Immediate*) or must first be processed in the user's "
"workspace (*To order*). The workspace offers processing options for:\n"
"- Sentinel-1 Level-1 SLC and\n"
"- Sentinel-2 L2A.\n"
"\n"
"The *To order* filter should therefore only be used when searching for one "
"of these two product types."
msgstr ""
"Dostupnost proizvoda pokazuje može li se proizvod preuzeti odmah (*Odmah*) "
"ili ga je najprije potrebno obraditi u korisnikovu radnom prostoru (*Za "
"naručivanje*). Radni prostor nudi mogućnosti obrade za:\n"
"- Sentinel-1 Level-1 SLC i\n"
"- Sentinel-2 L2A.\n"
"\n"
"Filtar *Za naručivanje* stoga bi se trebao koristiti samo pri pretraživanju "
"jedne od ove dvije vrste proizvoda."

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-1 data includes products from the Sentinel-1 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-1A (operational since 2014), "
"Sentinel-1B (operational from 2016 to 2022), Sentinel-1C (operational since "
"2025), Sentinel-1D (operational since 2026)."
msgstr ""
"Dostupni podaci Sentinel-1 uključuju proizvode satelitske konstelacije "
"Sentinel-1, uključujući Sentinel-1A (u radu od 2014.), Sentinel-1B (u radu "
"od 2016. do 2022.), Sentinel-1C (u radu od 2025.), Sentinel-1D (u radu od "
"2026.)."

msgid ""
"Determines whether the data was recorded during a descending orbit (flight "
"direction: north - south) or an ascending orbit (flight direction: south - "
"north)."
msgstr ""
"Određuje je li snimanje provedeno tijekom silazne orbite (smjer leta: "
"sjever - jug) ili uzlazne orbite (smjer leta: jug - sjever)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between successive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 to "
"the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending node "
"crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-1 is in a "
"near-polar, sun-synchronous orbit with a repeat cycle of 12 days and 175 "
"orbits per cycle for a single satellite."
msgstr ""
"Relativni broj orbite je broj punih orbita (između uzastopnih prelazaka "
"uzlaznog čvora preko ekvatora) od relativne orbite 1 do kraja ciklusa. "
"Relativna orbita 1 je orbita čiji je prelazak uzlaznog čvora najbliži "
"Greenwichkom meridijanu. Sentinel-1 je u gotovo polarnoj, sunčevo sinkronoj "
"orbiti s ciklusom ponavljanja od 12 dana i 175 orbita po ciklusu za jedan "
"satelit."

msgid ""
"Sentinel-1 operates in 4 exclusive instrument acquisition modes. Depending "
"on the instrument mode, the data products may be available in different "
"polarisation, resolution and swath withs (between 20 km and 410 km). The "
"four different modes are:\n"
"- Stripmap (SM) \n"
"- Interferometric Wide swath (IW)\n"
"- Extra-Wide swath (EW)\n"
"- Wave (WV)"
msgstr ""
"Sentinel-1 radi u 4 međusobno isključiva načina snimanja instrumenta. "
"Ovisno o načinu rada instrumenta, podatkovni proizvodi mogu biti dostupni u "
"različitim polarizacijama, razlučivostima i širinama pojasa snimanja "
"(između 20 km i 410 km). Četiri različita načina rada su:\n"
"- Stripmap (SM) \n"
"- Interferometric Wide swath (IW)\n"
"- Extra-Wide swath (EW)\n"
"- Wave (WV)"

msgid ""
"Depending on the acquistion mode, the following swaths and identifiers are "
"possible:\n"
"- S1-S6 for SM mode (currently the only supported option)\n"
"- IW1-IW3 for IW mode\n"
"- EW1-EW5 for EW mode\n"
"- WV1-WV2 for WV mode"
msgstr ""
"Ovisno o načinu snimanja, moguće su sljedeće trake snimanja i oznake:\n"
"- S1-S6 za način SM (trenutno jedina podržana opcija)\n"
"- IW1-IW3 za način IW\n"
"- EW1-EW5 za način EW\n"
"- WV1-WV2 za način WV"

msgid ""
"Determines with which polarisation the data was acquired. The first letter "
"indicates the polarisation when sending the signal, the second letter when "
"receiving the signal, e.g., HV = horizontal polarisation when sending the "
"signal and vertical polarisation when receiving.\n"
"\n"
"Data can be acquired in single polarisation HH (SH) or VV (SV) or in dual "
"polarisation HH&HV (DH) or VV&VH (DV), depending on the instrument mode.\n"
"\n"
"SM, IW and EW can be acquired in single or dual polarisation. WV can only "
"be acquired in single polarisation."
msgstr ""
"Određuje s kojom su polarizacijom podaci snimljeni. Prvo slovo označava "
"polarizaciju pri slanju signala, drugo pri primanju signala, npr. HV = "
"horizontalna polarizacija pri slanju signala i vertikalna polarizacija pri "
"primanju.\n"
"\n"
"Podaci se mogu snimati u jednostrukoj polarizaciji HH (SH) ili VV (SV) ili "
"u dvostrukoj polarizaciji HH&HV (DH) ili VV&VH (DV), ovisno o načinu rada "
"instrumenta.\n"
"\n"
"SM, IW i EW mogu se snimati u jednostrukoj ili dvostrukoj polarizaciji. WV "
"se može snimati samo u jednostrukoj polarizaciji."

msgid ""
"Only applies for Level-1 GRD products and varies depending on the "
"acquisition mode:\n"
"- 3.5 m pixel spacing (full resolution: only SM mode) \n"
"- 10 m pixel spacing (high resolution: SW, IW mode)\n"
"- 25 m pixel spacing (high resolution: EW mode; medium resolution: WV mode)\n"
"- 40 m pixel spacing (medium resolution: SM, IW, EW mode)"
msgstr ""
"Odnosi se samo na proizvode Level-1 GRD i varira ovisno o načinu snimanja:\n"
"- razmak piksela 3,5 m (puna razlučivost: samo način SM) \n"
"- razmak piksela 10 m (visoka razlučivost: načini SW, IW)\n"
"- razmak piksela 25 m (visoka razlučivost: način EW; srednja razlučivost: "
"način WV)\n"
"- razmak piksela 40 m (srednja razlučivost: načini SM, IW, EW)"

msgid ""
"Depending on the processing level different product classes are available:\n"
"- Standard (S): all processing levels\n"
"- Calibration (C): Level-0 products \n"
"- Noise (N): Level-0 products\n"
"- Annotation (A): Level-1 and Level-2 products"
msgstr ""
"Ovisno o razini obrade dostupne su različite klase proizvoda:\n"
"- Standardni (S): sve razine obrade\n"
"- Kalibracijski (C): proizvodi Level-0 \n"
"- Šum (N): proizvodi Level-0\n"
"- Anotacijski (A): proizvodi Level-1 i Level-2"

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-2 data includes products from the Sentinel-2 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-2A (operational since 2015) and "
"Sentinel-2B (operational since  2017)."
msgstr ""
"Dostupni podaci Sentinel-2 uključuju proizvode satelitske konstelacije "
"Sentinel-2, uključujući Sentinel-2A (u radu od 2015.) i Sentinel-2B (u radu "
"od 2017.)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between sucessive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 "
"until the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending "
"node crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-2 is in a "
"sun-synchronous orbit with a 10-day repeat cycle (5-days with both "
"satellites) and 143 orbits per cycle."
msgstr ""
"Relativni broj orbite je broj punih orbita (između uzastopnih prelazaka "
"uzlaznog čvora preko ekvatora) od relativne orbite 1 do kraja ciklusa. "
"Relativna orbita 1 je orbita čiji je prelazak uzlaznog čvora najbliži "
"Greenwichkom meridijanu. Sentinel-2 je u sunčevo sinkronoj orbiti s "
"ciklusom ponavljanja od 10 dana (5 dana s oba satelita) i 143 orbite po "
"ciklusu."

msgid "The available Sentinel-2 data is processed either by ESA or by CloudFerro."
msgstr "Dostupne podatke Sentinel-2 obrađuje ili ESA ili CloudFerro."

msgid ""
"Sentinel-3 data is  available in the following timeliness:\n"
"- Near Real Time (NRT):  typically available within 3 hours after data "
"acquisition\n"
"- Short Time Critical (STC): typically available within 48 hours after data "
"acquisition\n"
"- Non Time Critical (NTC): typically available within 1 months after data "
"acquisition"
msgstr ""
"Podaci Sentinel-3 dostupni su u sljedećim rokovima isporuke:\n"
"- Gotovo u stvarnom vremenu (NRT): obično dostupno unutar 3 sata nakon "
"prikupljanja podataka\n"
"- Kratki vremenski kritični (STC): obično dostupno unutar 48 sati nakon "
"prikupljanja podataka\n"
"- Vremenski nekritični (NTC): obično dostupno unutar 1 mjeseca nakon "
"prikupljanja podataka"

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-3 data includes products from the Sentinel-3 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-3A (operational since 2016) and "
"Sentinel-3B (operational since 2018)."
msgstr ""
"Dostupni podaci Sentinel-3 uključuju proizvode iz konstelacije satelita "
"Sentinel-3, uključujući Sentinel-3A (operativan od 2016.) i Sentinel-3B "
"(operativan od 2018.)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between successive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 "
"until the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending "
"node crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-3 is in a "
"near-polar, sun-synchronous orbit with a repeat cycle of 27 days."
msgstr ""
"Relativni broj orbite je broj punih orbita (između uzastopnih prelazaka "
"uzlaznog čvora preko ekvatora) od relativne orbite 1 do kraja ciklusa. "
"Relativna orbita 1 je orbita čiji je prelazak uzlaznog čvora najbliži "
"Greenwichkom meridijanu. Sentinel-3 nalazi se u gotovo polarnoj, "
"sunčevo-sinkronoj orbiti s ciklusom ponavljanja od 27 dana."

msgid ""
"The timeliness provides information about the delivery time of the data "
"product. For Sentinel-5P there are 3 different timeliness available:\n"
"- Near Real-Time (NRT): available within 3 hours of acquisition\n"
"- Offline: depending on the product, within 12 hours for Level 1B products\n"
"- Reprocessing: no time constraints (performed when major product upgrades "
"are required"
msgstr ""
"Rok isporuke daje informaciju o vremenu isporuke podatkovnog proizvoda. Za "
"Sentinel-5P dostupna su 3 različita roka isporuke:\n"
"- Gotovo u stvarnom vremenu (NRT): dostupno unutar 3 sata od prikupljanja\n"
"- Izvanmrežno (Offline): ovisno o proizvodu, unutar 12 sati za proizvode "
"razine 1B\n"
"- Ponovna obrada (Reprocessing): bez vremenskih ograničenja (provodi se "
"kada su potrebne veće nadogradnje proizvoda"

msgid ""
"The absolute Orbit Number is the number of orbits that have elapsed since "
"the first ascending node crossing after launch."
msgstr ""
"Apsolutni broj orbite je broj orbita koje su protekle od prvog prelaska "
"uzlaznog čvora nakon lansiranja."

msgid ""
"These are pre-operational product types generated by the S5P Product "
"Algorithm Laboratory service."
msgstr ""
"Ovo su predoperativni tipovi proizvoda koje generira usluga S5P Product "
"Algorithm Laboratory."

msgid ""
"The unique identifier for a metadata item, including the ground segment "
"namespace to ensure uniqueness within EOP. See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."
msgstr ""
"Jedinstveni identifikator za metapodatkovnu stavku, uključujući imenski "
"prostor zemaljskog segmenta radi osiguranja jedinstvenosti unutar EOP-a. "
"Više saznajte "
"[ovdje](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."

msgid ""
"Four characters code used for identifying the specific mission (e.g. SP05 "
"for Spot5, PH00 for Pleiades Constellation). See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."
msgstr ""
"Kod od četiri znaka za identifikaciju određene misije (npr. SP05 za Spot5, "
"PH00 za konstelaciju Pleiades). Više saznajte "
"[ovdje](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."

msgid ""
