"Full dataset identifier associated to the product (e.g. "
"SAR_SEA_ICE/RS02/Eurarctic). See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"sar-data)."
msgstr ""
"Puni identifikator skupa podataka povezanog s proizvodom (npr. "
"SAR_SEA_ICE/RS02/Eurarctic). Više saznajte "
"[ovdje](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
