msgid ""
"GLO-30 and GLO-90 are free and open COP DEM datasets, offering global "
"coverage at resolutions of 30 and 90 m."
msgstr ""
"GLO-30 i GLO-90 besplatni su i otvoreni skupovi podataka COP DEM, koji nude "
"globalnu pokrivenost razlučivosti 30 i 90 m."

msgid ""
"EEA-10 is a COP DEM dataset available for eligible users only, offering "
"European coverage at resolution of 10 m."
msgstr ""
"EEA-10 je skup podataka COP DEM dostupan samo ovlaštenim korisnicima, koji "
"nudi pokrivenost Europe razlučivosti 10 m."

msgid ""
"The unique identifier for a metadata item, including the ground segment "
"namespace to ensure uniqueness within EOP. See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."
msgstr ""
"Jedinstveni identifikator za metapodatkovnu stavku, uključujući imenski "
"prostor zemaljskog segmenta radi osiguranja jedinstvenosti unutar EOP-a. "
"Više saznajte "
"[ovdje](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."

msgid ""
"The delivery ID allows searching for a specific COP DEM delivery. See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."
msgstr ""
"ID isporuke omogućuje pretraživanje određene isporuke COP DEM-a. Više "
"saznajte "
"[ovdje](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."

msgid ""
"This attribute allows selection of available data for a specific grid ID. "
"See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj atribut omogućuje odabir dostupnih podataka za određeni ID mreže. Više "
"saznajte "
"[ovdje](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."

#. Shared across CLMS collections that expose these structural OData attributes.
msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. The format in which the data is stored "
"(NetCDF or Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF)."
msgstr ""
"Odnosi se na sve potkategorije. Format u kojem su podaci pohranjeni (NetCDF "
"ili Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF)."

msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. The unique identifier for the specific "
"dataset within this collection."
msgstr ""
"Odnosi se na sve potkategorije. Jedinstveni identifikator određenog skupa "
"podataka unutar ove kolekcije."

msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. The type of product, identifying the "
"thematic category or processing pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Odnosi se na sve potkategorije. Tip proizvoda, koji označava tematsku "
"kategoriju ili tijek obrade."

msgid ""
"Only applies to data sources within the Snow, Water Bodies and Auxiliary "
"Data categories."
msgstr ""
"Odnosi se samo na izvore podataka unutar kategorija Snijeg, Vodena tijela i "
"Pomoćni podaci."

msgid ""
"Only applies to data sources within Urban Atlas. Filters results by the "
"country the data covers. Country codes follow the Eurostat convention, see "
"the full list "
"[here](https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index."
"php?title=Glossary%3ACountry_codes)."
msgstr ""
"Odnosi se samo na izvore podataka unutar Urban Atlasa. Filtrira rezultate "
"prema državi koju podaci pokrivaju. Kodovi država prate konvenciju "
"Eurostata, cijeli popis pogledajte "
"[ovdje](https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index."
"php?title=Glossary%3ACountry_codes)."

msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. Missions whose input data was used to "
"process the product."
msgstr ""
"Odnosi se na sve potkategorije. Misije čiji su ulazni podaci korišteni za "
"obradu proizvoda."

msgid ""
"Near real-time consolidation level (RT0–RT6). RT0 is the fastest delivery; "
"RT6 has the highest accuracy. Only applies to data sources within the "
"Vegetation category."
msgstr ""
"Razina konsolidacije gotovo u stvarnom vremenu (RT0–RT6). RT0 je najbrža "
"isporuka; RT6 ima najvišu točnost. Odnosi se samo na izvore podataka unutar "
"kategorije Vegetacija."

msgid ""
"Only applies to data sources within Protected Areas. Filters results by "
"DUid (regional delivery unit code)."
msgstr ""
"Odnosi se samo na izvore podataka unutar Zaštićenih područja. Filtrira "
"rezultate prema DUid-u (kod regionalne jedinice isporuke)."

msgid "This data product was processed by EUMETSAT."
