msgid "We could not restore the compared layers. Please try opening the link again."
msgstr ""
"Nismo mogli vratiti uspoređivane slojeve. Pokušajte ponovno otvoriti "
"poveznicu."

msgid "Next"
msgstr "Dalje"

msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Prethodno"

msgid "End tutorial"
msgstr "Završi vodič"

msgid "Remind me later"
msgstr "Podsjeti me kasnije"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Zatvori"

msgid "Don't show again"
msgstr "Ne prikazuj ponovno"

msgid ""
"# Welcome to Copernicus Browser!\n"
"\n"
"A complete archive of Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Sentinel-3, Sentinel-5P, "
"Sentinel-6,  \n"
"Copernicus Contributing Missions (Optical, SAR and DEM), Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service (CLMS), and Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 Global Mosaics "
"data in one place.\n"
"\n"
"[About Copernicus Browser "
"page](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Applications/Browser."
"html)  \n"
"[Available data "
"collections](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections)"
msgstr ""
"# Dobrodošli u Copernicus Browser!\n"
"\n"
"Potpuni arhiv podataka Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Sentinel-3, Sentinel-5P, "
"Sentinel-6,  \n"
"Copernicus Contributing Missions (optičkih, SAR i DEM), usluge Copernicus "
"Land Monitoring Service (CLMS) te globalnih mozaika Sentinel-1 i Sentinel-2 "
"na jednom mjestu.\n"
"\n"
"[Stranica o aplikaciji Copernicus "
"Browser](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Applications/Browser."
"html)  \n"
"[Dostupne kolekcije "
"podataka](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections)"

msgid ""
"#### Quick overview of Copernicus Browser features\n"
"\n"
"Copernicus Browser serves as a central hub for accessing, exploring and "
"utilising the wealth of Earth observation and environmental \n"
"data provided by the Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Sentinel-3, Sentinel-5P, "
"Sentinel-6, Copernicus Contributing Missions (Optical, SAR and DEM), \n"
"and Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 Global Mosaics (see details "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data.html)). You "
"simply \n"
"go to your area of interest, select data sources, time range and cloud "
"coverage, and inspect the resulting data.\n"
"\n"
"You can continue the tutorial by clicking on the \"Next\" button or you can "
"close it. By clicking the info \n"
"icon <span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> "
"in the top right \n"
"corner you can always resume the tutorial in case you closed it by mistake "
"or because you wanted to try something out."
msgstr ""
"#### Kratki pregled značajki aplikacije Copernicus Browser\n"
"\n"
"Copernicus Browser služi kao središnje mjesto za pristup, istraživanje i "
"korištenje bogatstva podataka o promatranju Zemlje i okolišu \n"
"koje pružaju Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Sentinel-3, Sentinel-5P, Sentinel-6, "
"Copernicus Contributing Missions (optičke, SAR i DEM) \n"
"te globalni mozaici Sentinel-1 i Sentinel-2 (pojedinosti pogledajte "
"[ovdje](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data.html)). "
"Jednostavno \n"
"odete na svoje područje od interesa, odaberete izvore podataka, vremensko "
"razdoblje i naoblaku te pregledate dobivene podatke.\n"
"\n"
"Vodič možete nastaviti klikom na gumb \"Dalje\" ili ga možete zatvoriti. "
"Klikom na ikonu informacija \n"
"<span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> u "
"gornjem desnom \n"
"kutu uvijek možete nastaviti vodič ako ste ga zatvorili greškom ili ste "
"željeli nešto isprobati."

msgid ""
"Anonymous use of the Browser gives you access with limited functionality. "
"To be able to use all functions, you need a free account. \n"
"**Logged-in users** can use their custom themes, save and load pins, "
"measure distances, create a timelapse and use the extended image download."
msgstr ""
"Anonimno korištenje preglednika daje vam pristup s ograničenom "
"funkcionalnošću. Za korištenje svih funkcija potreban vam je besplatan "
"račun. \n"
"**Prijavljeni korisnici** mogu koristiti vlastite teme, spremati i "
"učitavati pribadače, mjeriti udaljenosti, izraditi vremenski slijed i "
"koristiti prošireno preuzimanje slika."

msgid ""
"In the **Visualise tab** you can:\n"
"- Search for a **Date**.\n"
"- Select a **Theme**.\n"
"- Choose a **Collection**.\n"
"- Select a **Visualisation Layer**.\n"
"\n"
"You can change the **Date** (type in or select it from the calendar) and "
"set the cloud coverage. You can choose between \n"
"single date, mosaic and time range: ![Single](icon) ![Mosaic](icon) ![Time "
"Range](icon).\n"
"\n"
"The **Configurations** dropdown offers you different preconfigured themes "
"and your own custom configured instances if\n"
"you are logged in. To create an instance, go to your [personal "
"dashboard](https://shapps.dataspace.copernicus.eu/dashboard/).\n"
"\n"
"You can select a desired data source in the **Data Collections**. You can "
"read explanations of the satellites by clicking \n"
"on the information icon next to the name of the data collection. Here you "
"can also switch between different panels: \n"
"![Layers](icon) Layers, ![Highlights](icon) Highlights, ![Compare "
"mode](icon) Compare mode and ![Pins](icon) Pins."
msgstr ""
"U **kartici Vizualizacija** možete:\n"
"- Pretražiti **datum**.\n"
"- Odabrati **temu**.\n"
"- Odabrati **kolekciju**.\n"
"- Odabrati **sloj vizualizacije**.\n"
"\n"
"**Datum** možete promijeniti (upisati ga ili odabrati iz kalendara) i "
"postaviti naoblaku. Možete birati između \n"
"pojedinačnog datuma, mozaika i vremenskog razdoblja: ![Single](icon) "
"![Mosaic](icon) ![Time Range](icon).\n"
"\n"
"Padajući izbornik **Konfiguracije** nudi vam različite unaprijed "
"konfigurirane teme i vaše vlastite prilagođene instance ako \n"
"ste prijavljeni. Za izradu instance idite na svoju [osobnu nadzornu "
"ploču](https://shapps.dataspace.copernicus.eu/dashboard/).\n"
"\n"
"Željeni izvor podataka možete odabrati u **Kolekcijama podataka**. "
"Objašnjenja o satelitima možete pročitati klikom \n"
"na ikonu informacija pokraj naziva kolekcije podataka. Ovdje također možete "
"prebacivati između različitih ploča: \n"
"![Layers](icon) Slojevi, ![Highlights](icon) Istaknuto, ![Compare "
"mode](icon) Način usporedbe i ![Pins](icon) Pribadače."

msgid ""
"You can select different pre-installed or custom spectral band combinations "
"to visualise data for the selected result.\n"
"\n"
"Some of the common options:\n"
"- **True Color** - Visual interpretation of land cover\n"
"- **False Color** - Visual interpretation of vegetation\n"
"- **NDVI** - Vegetation index\n"
"- **Moisture index** - Moisture index\n"
"- **SWIR** - Shortwave-infrared index\n"
"- **NDWI** - Normalized Difference Water Index\n"
"- **NDSI** - Normalized Difference Snow Index\n"
"\n"
"Most visualisations are given a description and a legend, which you can "
"view by clicking on the expand sign ![expand](icon).\n"
"Each of the layers offers an option to add it to Compare or Pins by "
"clicking <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> Add to</span>.\n"
"Based on your action, the Compare and Pins panels will include added layers "
"![compare-with-badge](icon) ![pins-with-badge](icon)\n"
"which you can further organise and analyse under each tab.\n"
"\n"
"Click on the **Custom visualisation** option to select custom band "
"combinations, index combinations or write your own classification script "
"for the\n"
"visualisation of data. You can also use custom scripts, which are stored "
"elsewhere, either on Google Drive, GitHub or in our\n"
"[Custom script repository](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/). Paste "
"the URL of the script into the text box in the advanced script editing "
"panel\n"
"and click Refresh. The custom script of preconfigured layers can be edited "
"by choosing the code icon ![code-icon](icon).\n"
"\n"
"You can select <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-sliders\"></i></span> "
"**Show effects and advanced options** like the sampling method, advanced "
"RGB effects or apply \n"
"contrast (gain) and luminance (gamma). To return to preconfigured layers, "
"click <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-paint-brush\"></i></span> "
"**Show visualisations**.\n"
"**Share** your visualisation on social media by clicking on the share icon "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-share-alt\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati različite unaprijed instalirane ili prilagođene kombinacije "
"spektralnih pojasa za vizualizaciju podataka odabranog rezultata.\n"
"\n"
"Neke uobičajene opcije:\n"
"- **Prava boja** - vizualna interpretacija pokrova zemljišta\n"
"- **Lažne boje** - vizualna interpretacija vegetacije\n"
"- **NDVI** - indeks vegetacije\n"
"- **Indeks vlažnosti** - indeks vlažnosti\n"
"- **SWIR** - indeks kratkovalnog infracrvenog\n"
"- **NDWI** - normalizirani diferencijalni indeks vode\n"
"- **NDSI** - normalizirani diferencijalni indeks snijega\n"
"\n"
"Većina vizualizacija ima opis i legendu, koje možete pogledati klikom na "
"znak za proširenje ![expand](icon).\n"
"Svaki od slojeva nudi opciju dodavanja u Usporedbu ili Pribadače klikom na "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> Dodaj u</span>.\n"
"Ovisno o vašoj radnji, ploče Usporedba i Pribadače sadržavat će dodane "
"slojeve ![compare-with-badge](icon) ![pins-with-badge](icon)\n"
"koje možete dalje organizirati i analizirati pod svakom karticom.\n"
"\n"
"Klikom na opciju **Prilagođena vizualizacija** možete odabrati prilagođene "
"kombinacije pojasa, kombinacije indeksa ili napisati vlastitu skriptu za "
"klasifikaciju za\n"
"vizualizaciju podataka. Možete koristiti i prilagođene skripte pohranjene "
"drugdje, na Google Driveu, GitHubu ili u našem\n"
"[repozitoriju prilagođenih "
"skripti](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/). Zalijepite URL skripte "
"u tekstni okvir u naprednom panelu za uređivanje skripte\n"
"i kliknite Osvježi. Prilagođena skripta unaprijed konfiguriranih slojeva "
"može se urediti odabirom ikone koda ![code-icon](icon).\n"
"\n"
"Možete odabrati <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-sliders\"></i></span> "
"**Prikaži efekte i napredne opcije** poput metode uzorkovanja, naprednih "
"RGB efekata ili primijeniti \n"
"kontrast (gain) i luminanciju (gamma). Za povratak na unaprijed "
"konfigurirane slojeve kliknite <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-paint-brush\"></i></span> **Prikaži vizualizacije**.\n"
"**Podijelite** svoju vizualizaciju na društvenim mrežama klikom na ikonu za "
"dijeljenje <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-share-alt\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"If you choose one of the preconfigured themes under **Configurations**, you "
"will be able to select from a highlights list under the Highlights panel.\n"
"\n"
"Each highlight has a description accessible under the dropdown icon "
"![expand-description](icon)."
msgstr ""
"Ako odaberete jednu od unaprijed konfiguriranih tema pod **Konfiguracije**, "
"moći ćete birati s popisa istaknutih sadržaja na ploči Istaknuto.\n"
"\n"
"Svaki istaknuti sadržaj ima opis dostupan pod ikonom padajućeg izbornika "
"![expand-description](icon)."

msgid ""
"Here you will find all visualisations that you added by clicking <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> Add to</span> on \n"
"the layers under the Layers panel.\n"
"\n"
"There are two modes of comparing:\n"
"- **Opacity** (drag opacity slider left or right to fade between compared "
"images)\n"
"- **Split** (drag split slider left or right to set the boundary between "
"compared images)"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje ćete pronaći sve vizualizacije koje ste dodali klikom na <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> Dodaj u</span> na \n"
"slojevima na ploči Slojevi.\n"
"\n"
"Postoje dva načina usporedbe:\n"
"- **Prozirnost** (povucite klizač prozirnosti ulijevo ili udesno za "
"prijelaz između uspoređivanih slika)\n"
"- **Podjela** (povucite klizač podjele ulijevo ili udesno za postavljanje "
"granice između uspoređivanih slika)"

msgid ""
"The **Pins** panel contains your pinned (favourite/saved) items. Pinned "
"items contain information about location, data source \n"
"and its specific layer, zoom level and time. To reorder the pins, choose "
"among the options in the **Order by** dropdown.\n"
"\n"
"You have several ways to interact with each pin:\n"
"- Change **order** - by clicking on the move icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-ellipsis-v\"></i><i class=\"fa fa-ellipsis-v\"></i></span> \n"
"in the top left corner of the pin and dragging the pin up or down the list.\n"
"- **Rename** - by clicking on the pencil icon ![rename](icon) next to the "
"pin's name.\n"
"- Add to the **Compare** panel - by clicking on the compare icon "
"![compare](icon).\n"
"- Enter a **description** - by clicking on the expand icon ![expand](icon).\n"
"- **Remove** - by clicking the remove icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"- **Zoom** to the pin's location - by clicking on the Lat/Lon.\n"
"\n"
"In the line above your pins, you have different options that apply to all "
"pins:\n"
"- Create your own story from pins - by clicking on **Story**.\n"
"- Share your pins with others via a link - by clicking on **Share**.\n"
"- Export pins as a JSON file - by clicking on **Export**.\n"
"- Import pins from a JSON file - by clicking on **Import**.\n"
"- Delete all pins - by clicking on **Clear**."
msgstr ""
"Ploča **Pribadače** sadrži vaše prikvačene (omiljene/spremljene) stavke. "
"Prikvačene stavke sadrže informacije o lokaciji, izvoru podataka \n"
"i njegovom određenom sloju, razini zumiranja i vremenu. Za promjenu "
"redoslijeda pribadača odaberite među opcijama u padajućem izborniku "
"**Poredak**.\n"
"\n"
"Svaku pribadaču možete koristiti na nekoliko načina:\n"
"- Promijeniti **redoslijed** - klikom na ikonu premještanja <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-ellipsis-v\"></i><i class=\"fa "
"fa-ellipsis-v\"></i></span> \n"
"u gornjem lijevom kutu pribadače i povlačenjem pribadače prema gore ili "
"dolje po popisu.\n"
"- **Preimenovati** - klikom na ikonu olovke ![rename](icon) pokraj naziva "
"pribadače.\n"
"- Dodati na ploču **Usporedba** - klikom na ikonu usporedbe "
"![compare](icon).\n"
"- Unijeti **opis** - klikom na ikonu proširenja ![expand](icon).\n"
"- **Ukloniti** - klikom na ikonu uklanjanja <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"- **Zumirati** na lokaciju pribadače - klikom na geografsku širinu/dužinu.\n"
"\n"
"U retku iznad pribadača nalaze se različite opcije koje se odnose na sve "
"pribadače:\n"
"- Izraditi vlastitu priču od pribadača - klikom na **Priča**.\n"
"- Podijeliti pribadače s drugima putem poveznice - klikom na **Podijeli**.\n"
"- Izvesti pribadače kao JSON datoteku - klikom na **Izvezi**.\n"
"- Uvesti pribadače iz JSON datoteke - klikom na **Uvezi**.\n"
"- Izbrisati sve pribadače - klikom na **Očisti**."

msgid ""
"The **WMS/WMTS panel** lets you add third-party map layers to Copernicus "
"Browser via a service **GetCapabilities URL**.\n"
"\n"
"To **add a service** - paste its GetCapabilities URL into the input field "
"and click the add button <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-plus\"></i></span> (or press Enter). The service and its layers appear "
"alongside the standard collections.\n"
"\n"
"Once a service is loaded, you can:\n"
"- View **service details** (description, access constraints and fees) - by "
"clicking on the info icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-info\"></i></span> next to the service name.\n"
"- **Select** a service - by clicking on its name; the active service is "
"marked with a checkmark and its layers are listed below.\n"
"- **Remove** a service - by clicking on the remove icon <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"In the layer list you can **search** layers by name, page through them with "
"the <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-left\"></i></span> and "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span> "
"controls, and pick how many layers to show per page. Click a layer to "
"display it on the map. On the active layer, use **Add to** <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span> to add it to the "
"**Compare** or **Pins** panels."
msgstr ""
"**Ploča WMS/WMTS** omogućuje dodavanje slojeva karata trećih strana u "
"Copernicus Browser putem **GetCapabilities URL-a** usluge.\n"
"\n"
"Za **dodavanje usluge** - zalijepite njezin GetCapabilities URL u polje za "
"unos i kliknite gumb za dodavanje <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-plus\"></i></span> (ili pritisnite Enter). Usluga i njezini slojevi "
"pojavljuju se uz standardne kolekcije.\n"
"\n"
"Kad se usluga učita, možete:\n"
"- Pogledati **pojedinosti usluge** (opis, ograničenja pristupa i naknade) - "
"klikom na ikonu informacija <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-info\"></i></span> pokraj naziva usluge.\n"
"- **Odabrati** uslugu - klikom na njezin naziv; aktivna usluga označena je "
"kvačicom, a njezini slojevi navedeni su ispod.\n"
"- **Ukloniti** uslugu - klikom na ikonu uklanjanja <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"U popisu slojeva možete **pretraživati** slojeve po nazivu, listati ih "
"pomoću kontrola <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-chevron-left\"></i></span> i <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-chevron-right\"></i></span> te odabrati koliko slojeva prikazati po "
"stranici. Kliknite sloj za prikaz na karti. Na aktivnom sloju upotrijebite "
"**Dodaj u** <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span> za "
"dodavanje u ploče **Usporedba** ili **Pribadače**."

msgid ""
"Under **Search** you can set:\n"
"- **Search criteria** by a product name.\n"
"- Choose from which **data sources** you want to receive the data by "
"selecting checkboxes. Where applicable, you can also set **filters**\n"
"such as satellite platform, orbit direction, relative orbit, number, "
"acquisition mode, product availability, timeliness, etc.\n"
"- Select the **time range** by either typing the date or selecting it from "
"the calendar. If you want to omit some of the months, enable\n"
"the **Filter by months** option and uncheck the non-relevant months.\n"
"\n"
"Once you hit Search you get a list of results. Each result is presented "
"with a preview image and relevant data specific to the data source.\n"
"For **product info** and **zooming to product**, click on the <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i></span> and <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> icons.\n"
"If you are logged in, you can click on ![workspace-add](icon) to **add a "
"product to your Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem Workspace**\n"
"to easily collect and process your satellite data. You can also **download "
"the product** by clicking on the download icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-download\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Clicking on the Visualise button will open the **Visualise** tab for the "
"selected result."
msgstr ""
"Pod **Pretraga** možete postaviti:\n"
"- **Kriterije pretraživanja** prema nazivu proizvoda.\n"
"- Odabrati iz kojih **izvora podataka** želite primati podatke označavanjem "
"potvrdnih okvira. Gdje je primjenjivo, možete postaviti i **filtre**\n"
"poput satelitske platforme, smjera orbite, relativne orbite, broja, načina "
"snimanja, dostupnosti proizvoda, roka isporuke itd.\n"
"- Odabrati **vremensko razdoblje** upisivanjem datuma ili odabirom iz "
"kalendara. Ako želite izostaviti neke mjesece, uključite\n"
"opciju **Filtriraj po mjesecima** i isključite nerelevantne mjesece.\n"
"\n"
"Nakon klika na Pretraga dobivate popis rezultata. Svaki rezultat prikazan "
"je sa slikom pregleda i relevantnim podacima specifičnim za izvor podataka.\n"
"Za **informacije o proizvodu** i **zumiranje na proizvod** kliknite ikone "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i></span> i <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-crosshairs\"></i></span>.\n"
"Ako ste prijavljeni, možete kliknuti ![workspace-add](icon) za **dodavanje "
"proizvoda u svoj radni prostor Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem**\n"
"radi jednostavnog prikupljanja i obrade satelitskih podataka. **Proizvod** "
"možete i **preuzeti** klikom na ikonu preuzimanja <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-download\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Klikom na gumb Vizualizacija otvorit će se kartica **Vizualizacija** za "
"odabrani rezultat."

msgid ""
"Search for a location either by scrolling the map with a mouse or by "
"entering the location in the **Go to Place** field."
msgstr ""
"Potražite lokaciju pomicanjem karte mišem ili unosom lokacije u polje **Idi "
"na mjesto**."

msgid ""
"Here you can select which base layer and overlays (borders, labels) are "
"shown on the map."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete odabrati koji se osnovni sloj i prekrivanja (granice, oznake) "
"prikazuju na karti."

msgid ""
"You can view the tutorial anytime by clicking on this info icon <span "
"class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"Vodič možete pogledati u bilo kojem trenutku klikom na ovu ikonu "
"informacija <span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-info\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to draw a polygon on the map and display the polygon's "
"size.\n"
"\n"
"All layers that return a single value (such as NDVI, Moisture Index, NDWI, "
"...) support viewing the index\n"
"for the selected area over time. Clicking the chart icon <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-bar-chart\"></i></span> will\n"
"display the statistical information charts (you need to be logged in to use "
"this option). You can remove the polygon \n"
"by clicking the remove icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-close\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"You can also upload a KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (in EPSG:4326) or GEOJSON/JSON file "
"with a polygon geometry using the\n"
"upload icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"The two sheets icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> lets you copy the polygon coordinates as a \n"
"GEOJSON and the crosshair <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> centers the map on the drawn polygon."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj alat omogućuje crtanje poligona na karti i prikaz veličine poligona.\n"
"\n"
"Svi slojevi koji vraćaju jednu vrijednost (poput NDVI-ja, indeksa "
"vlažnosti, NDWI-ja, ...) podržavaju prikaz indeksa\n"
"za odabrano područje tijekom vremena. Klikom na ikonu grafikona <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-bar-chart\"></i></span> prikazat će se\n"
"grafikoni statističkih informacija (za korištenje ove opcije morate biti "
"prijavljeni). Poligon možete ukloniti \n"
"klikom na ikonu uklanjanja <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-close\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Možete i učitati KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (u EPSG:4326) ili GEOJSON/JSON datoteku "
"s geometrijom poligona pomoću\n"
"ikone za učitavanje <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Ikona dvaju listova <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> omogućuje kopiranje koordinata poligona kao \n"
"GEOJSON, a nitni križ <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> centrira kartu na nacrtani poligon."

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to draw a line on the map and display the line length.\n"
"\n"
"It also includes the **Elevation Profile**, a tool that allows you to "
"create the altitude profile by defining a line from point A to point B.\n"
"\n"
"You can also upload a KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (in EPSG:4326) or GEOJSON/JSON file "
"using the upload icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"The two sheets icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> lets you copy the line coordinates as a \n"
"GEOJSON and the crosshair <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> centers the map on the drawn line."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj alat omogućuje crtanje linije na karti i prikaz duljine linije.\n"
"\n"
"Uključuje i **Visinski profil**, alat koji omogućuje izradu visinskog "
"profila definiranjem linije od točke A do točke B.\n"
"\n"
"Možete i učitati KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (u EPSG:4326) ili GEOJSON/JSON datoteku "
"pomoću ikone za učitavanje <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Ikona dvaju listova <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> omogućuje kopiranje koordinata linije kao \n"
"GEOJSON, a nitni križ <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> centrira kartu na nacrtanu liniju."

msgid ""
"With this tool, you can mark a point on the map.\n"
"\n"
"You can also view statistical data for some layers by clicking on the chart "
"icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-bar-chart\"></i></span>. \n"
"You can remove the mark by clicking the remove icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"Pomoću ovog alata možete označiti točku na karti.\n"
"\n"
"Možete pogledati i statističke podatke za neke slojeve klikom na ikonu "
"grafikona <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-bar-chart\"></i></span>. \n"
"Oznaku možete ukloniti klikom na ikonu uklanjanja <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"With this tool, you can measure distances and areas on the map.\n"
"\n"
"Every mouse click creates a new point on the path. To stop adding points, "
"press the <code>Esc</code> key or double-click on the map.  \n"
"You can remove the measurement by clicking the remove icon <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"Pomoću ovog alata možete mjeriti udaljenosti i površine na karti.\n"
"\n"
"Svaki klik mišem stvara novu točku na putanji. Za prestanak dodavanja "
"točaka pritisnite tipku <code>Esc</code> ili dvaput kliknite na kartu.  \n"
"Mjerenje možete ukloniti klikom na ikonu uklanjanja <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"With this tool, you can download an image of visualised data for the "
"displayed location. You can choose to show \n"
"captions and you can add your own description. By enabling Analytical mode, "
"you can choose between various image formats, \n"
"image resolutions and coordinate systems. You can also select multiple "
"layers and download them as a <code>.zip</code> file.\n"
"\n"
"Click the download button <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-download\"></i> Download</span> and your image(s) will \n"
"begin to download. The process can take a few seconds, depending on the "
"selected resolution and the number of selected layers.\n"
"\n"
"Before downloading, you can define an area of interest (AOI) by clicking on "
"the Area selection tool icon ![selection](icon).\n"
"Your data will be clipped to match this area."
msgstr ""
"Pomoću ovog alata možete preuzeti sliku vizualiziranih podataka za "
"prikazanu lokaciju. Možete odabrati prikaz \n"
"natpisa i dodati vlastiti opis. Uključivanjem analitičkog načina možete "
"birati između raznih formata slike, \n"
"razlučivosti slike i koordinatnih sustava. Možete odabrati i više slojeva "
"te ih preuzeti kao <code>.zip</code> datoteku.\n"
"\n"
"Kliknite gumb za preuzimanje <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-download\"></i> Preuzmi</span> i vaše slike će \n"
"se početi preuzimati. Postupak može trajati nekoliko sekundi, ovisno o "
"odabranoj razlučivosti i broju odabranih slojeva.\n"
"\n"
"Prije preuzimanja možete definirati područje od interesa (AOI) klikom na "
"ikonu alata za odabir područja ![selection](icon).\n"
"Vaši podaci bit će izrezani prema tom području."

msgid ""
"With this tool (available to logged-in users), you can create a timelapse "
"animation of the visualised layer and displayed location.\n"
"\n"
"First, choose a time range. You can refine your search results further via "
"the **Filter by months** checkbox and/or by selecting one\n"
"image per defined period (orbit, day, week, month, year).\n"
"\n"
"Then press <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-search\"></i> "
"Search</span> and select your images. You can select all \n"
"by checking the checkbox or filter the images by cloud coverage by moving "
"the slider. Or you can pick images one by one by scrolling \n"
"through the list and selecting them. Via the **Borders** checkbox, you can "
"enable/disable the borders on your image.\n"
"\n"
"You can preview the timelapse by pressing the play button <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-play-circle\"></i></span>, set the speed "
"(frames per second)\n"
"and transition mode, all available at the bottom of the screen. See "
"additional settings by clicking the\n"
"settings icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-cogs\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"When you are satisfied with the result, click the download button and the "
"timelapse will be downloaded as a <code>.gif</code> or <code>.mp4</code> "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Pomoću ovog alata (dostupnog prijavljenim korisnicima) možete izraditi "
"animaciju vremenskog slijeda vizualiziranog sloja i prikazane lokacije.\n"
"\n"
"Najprije odaberite vremensko razdoblje. Rezultate pretrage možete dodatno "
"suziti pomoću potvrdnog okvira **Filtriraj po mjesecima** i/ili odabirom "
"jedne\n"
"slike po definiranom razdoblju (orbita, dan, tjedan, mjesec, godina).\n"
"\n"
"Zatim pritisnite <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-search\"></i> "
"Pretraga</span> i odaberite svoje slike. Sve možete odabrati \n"
"označavanjem potvrdnog okvira ili filtrirati slike prema naoblaci "
"pomicanjem klizača. Ili možete birati slike jednu po jednu listanjem \n"
"po popisu i odabirom. Pomoću potvrdnog okvira **Granice** možete "
"uključiti/isključiti granice na slici.\n"
"\n"
"Vremenski slijed možete pregledati pritiskom na gumb za reprodukciju <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-play-circle\"></i></span>, postaviti "
"brzinu (broj sličica u sekundi)\n"
"i način prijelaza, sve dostupno pri dnu zaslona. Dodatne postavke "
"pogledajte klikom na\n"
"ikonu postavki <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-cogs\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Kad ste zadovoljni rezultatom, kliknite gumb za preuzimanje i vremenski "
"slijed bit će preuzet kao datoteka <code>.gif</code> ili <code>.mp4</code>."

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to navigate and fly through terrain effortlessly.\n"
"\n"
"You can make use of the 3D feature by utilising the following tools:\n"
"- Use **Vertical Terrain Scaling** to make flatter areas appear more "
"dynamic\n"
"- Simulate the Sun's movements and its projected shadows at any time of the "
"day\n"
"- Manipulate the **Shadow Parameters**\n"
"  - Shadow visibility\n"
"  - Shadow rendering distance\n"
"  - Shadow map size\n"
"- Control the ambient, diffuse and specular factors as well as specular "
"power\n"
"- Use the **Anaglyph Stereo Mode** to create two distinct red and blue "
"images to produce a single 3D stereo image"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj alat omogućuje vam jednostavno kretanje i letenje iznad terena.\n"
"\n"
"Možete iskoristiti 3D značajku pomoću sljedećih alata:\n"
"- Upotrijebite **okomito skaliranje terena** kako bi ravnija područja "
"izgledala dinamičnije\n"
"- Simulirajte kretanje Sunca i njegovu projiciranu sjenu u bilo koje doba "
"dana\n"
"- Podesite **parametre sjene**\n"
"  - Vidljivost sjene\n"
"  - Udaljenost iscrtavanja sjene\n"
"  - Veličina mape sjene\n"
"- Upravljajte ambijentalnim, difuznim i spekularnim faktorima te "
"spekularnom snagom\n"
"- Upotrijebite **anaglifni stereo način** za izradu dviju zasebnih crvenih "
"i plavih slika radi dobivanja jedne 3D stereo slike"

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to calculate and display statistical data (the "
"distribution of values) for specific layers.\n"
"\n"
"It is calculated for the data within your AOI (if defined) or otherwise for "
"the whole screen.\n"
"\n"
"You can hover over the bars in the histogram to read the values and "
"determine thresholds to distinguish between different spectral signatures.\n"
"\n"
"This tool currently only works for index layers (e.g. the NDVI)."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj alat omogućuje izračun i prikaz statističkih podataka (distribucije "
"vrijednosti) za određene slojeve.\n"
"\n"
"Izračunava se za podatke unutar vašeg AOI-ja (ako je definiran) ili inače "
"za cijeli zaslon.\n"
"\n"
"Mišem možete prijeći preko stupaca u histogramu kako biste pročitali "
"vrijednosti i odredili pragove za razlikovanje različitih spektralnih "
"potpisa.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj alat trenutačno radi samo za slojeve indeksa (npr. NDVI)."

msgid ""
"You have reached the end of the tutorial. If you have any other questions, "
"feel free to ask us on \n"
"[our forum](https://forum.dataspace.copernicus.eu/) or [submit a "
"request](https://helpcenter.dataspace.copernicus.eu/hc/en-gb/requests/new).\n"
"\n"
"If you would like to view the tutorial in the future, you can always access "
"it by clicking the info \n"
"icon <span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> "
"in the top right corner."
msgstr ""
"Došli ste do kraja vodiča. Ako imate još pitanja, slobodno nas pitajte na \n"
"[našem forumu](https://forum.dataspace.copernicus.eu/) ili [pošaljite "
"zahtjev](https://helpcenter.dataspace.copernicus.eu/hc/en-gb/requests/new).\n"
"\n"
"Ako želite pogledati vodič u budućnosti, uvijek mu možete pristupiti klikom "
"na ikonu \n"
"informacija <span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-info\"></i></span> u gornjem desnom kutu."

msgid ""
"#### Quick overview of Copernicus Browser features\n"
"\n"
"If you have a small screen, please go "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Applications/Browser."
"html) to view our user guide.\n"
"\n"
"You can always view this info again by clicking the info icon <span "
"class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> in the top "
"right corner.\n"
"\n"
"#### Other resources\n"
"- [Available data "
"collections](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections)"
msgstr ""
"#### Kratki pregled značajki aplikacije Copernicus Browser\n"
"\n"
"Ako imate mali zaslon, posjetite [ovu "
"stranicu](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Applications/"
"Browser.html) za pregled našeg korisničkog vodiča.\n"
"\n"
"Te informacije uvijek možete ponovno pogledati klikom na ikonu informacija "
"<span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> u "
"gornjem desnom kutu.\n"
"\n"
"#### Ostali resursi\n"
"- [Dostupne kolekcije "
"podataka](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections)"

