msgid ""
"**Sentinel-5P** is a satellite that provides atmospheric measurements to be "
"used for air quality, ozone monitoring, UV radiation,\n"
"and climate monitoring and forecasting.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 7 x 3.5km (that is, only details bigger than 7 x "
"3.5km can be seen).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 1 day to revisit the same area.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since April 2018 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Monitoring the concentration of carbon monoxide (CO), "
"nitrogen dioxide (NO2) and ozone (O3) in the air. Monitoring the UV aerosol "
"index (AER_AI) and various geophysical parameters of clouds (Cloud)."
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-5P** je satelit koji pruža atmosferska mjerenja za potrebe "
"kvalitete zraka, praćenja ozona, UV zračenja\n"
"te praćenja i prognoziranja klime.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost:** 7 x 3,5 km (to jest, vide se samo detalji veći "
"od 7 x 3,5 km).\n"
"\n"
"**Vrijeme ponovnog posjeta:** najviše 1 dan za ponovni posjet istog "
"područja.\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** od travnja 2018. nadalje.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba:** praćenje koncentracije ugljikova monoksida (CO), "
"dušikova dioksida (NO2) i ozona (O3) u zraku. Praćenje UV indeksa aerosola "
"(AER_AI) i raznih geofizičkih parametara oblaka (Cloud)."

msgid ""
"### Ozone (O3)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ozone is of crucial importance for the equilibrium of the Earth atmosphere. "
"In the stratosphere, the ozone layer shields the biosphere from dangerous "
"solar ultraviolet radiation. In the troposphere, it acts as an efficient "
"cleansing agent, but at high concentration it also becomes harmful to the "
"health of humans, animals, and vegetation. Ozone is also an important "
"greenhouse-gas contributor to ongoing climate change. Since the discovery "
"of the Antarctic ozone hole in the 1980s and the subsequent Montreal "
"Protocol regulating the production of chlorine-containing ozone-depleting "
"substances, ozone has been routinely monitored from the ground and from "
"space. Measurements are in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ozone-profile)"
msgstr ""
"### Ozon (O3)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ozon je od presudne važnosti za ravnotežu Zemljine atmosfere. U stratosferi "
"ozonski omotač štiti biosferu od opasnog sunčeva ultraljubičastog zračenja. "
"U troposferi djeluje kao učinkovito sredstvo za čišćenje, ali pri visokim "
"koncentracijama postaje i štetan za zdravlje ljudi, životinja i vegetacije. "
"Ozon je također važan staklenički plin koji doprinosi aktualnim klimatskim "
"promjenama. Od otkrića antarktičke ozonske rupe 1980-ih i potonjeg "
"Montrealskog protokola koji regulira proizvodnju tvari koje oštećuju ozon i "
"sadrže klor, ozon se redovito prati sa Zemlje i iz svemira. Mjerenja su u "
"molovima po četvornom metru (mol/ m^2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Više informacija "
"[ovdje.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ozone-profile)"

msgid ""
"### Nitrogen Dioxide (NO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Nitrogen dioxide (NO2) and nitrogen oxide (NO) together are usually "
"referred to as nitrogen oxides. They are important trace gases in the "
"Earth’s atmosphere, present in both the troposphere and the stratosphere. "
"They enter the atmosphere as a result of anthropogenic activities "
"(particularly fossil fuel combustion and biomass burning) and natural "
"processes (such as microbiological processes in soils, wildfires and "
"lightning). Measurements are in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-nitrogen-"
"dioxide)"
msgstr ""
"### Dušikov dioksid (NO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Dušikov dioksid (NO2) i dušikov oksid (NO) zajedno se obično nazivaju "
"dušikovim oksidima. To su važni plinovi u tragovima u Zemljinoj atmosferi, "
"prisutni i u troposferi i u stratosferi. U atmosferu dospijevaju kao "
"rezultat antropogenih aktivnosti (osobito izgaranja fosilnih goriva i "
"spaljivanja biomase) i prirodnih procesa (poput mikrobioloških procesa u "
"tlu, šumskih požara i munja). Mjerenja su u molovima po četvornom metru "
"(mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Više informacija "
"[ovdje.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-nitrogen-"
"dioxide)"

msgid ""
"### Sulfur Dioxide (SO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Sulphur dioxide enters the Earth’s atmosphere through both natural and "
"anthropogenic (human made) processes. It plays a role in chemistry on a "
"local and global scale and its impact ranges from short term pollution to "
"effects on climate. Only about 30% of the emitted SO2 comes from natural "
"sources; the majority is of anthropogenic origin. Sentinel-5P/TROPOMI "
"instrument samples the Earth’s surface with a revisit time of one day with "
"a spatial resolution of 3.5 x 7 km which allows the resolution of fine "
"details including the detection of smaller SO2 plumes. Measurements are in "
"mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-sulphur-dioxide)"
msgstr ""
"### Sumporov dioksid (SO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Sumporov dioksid dospijeva u Zemljinu atmosferu i prirodnim i antropogenim "
"(ljudskim) procesima. Ima ulogu u kemiji na lokalnoj i globalnoj razini, a "
"njegov utjecaj seže od kratkotrajnog onečišćenja do učinaka na klimu. Samo "
"oko 30 % emitiranog SO2 potječe iz prirodnih izvora; većina je antropogenog "
"podrijetla. Instrument Sentinel-5P/TROPOMI snima Zemljinu površinu s "
"vremenom ponovnog posjeta od jednog dana i prostornom razlučivošću od 3,5 x "
"7 km, što omogućuje razlučivanje finih detalja uključujući otkrivanje "
"manjih oblaka SO2. Mjerenja su u molovima po četvornom metru (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Više informacija "
"[ovdje.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-sulphur-dioxide)"

msgid ""
"### Carbon Monoxide (CO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Carbon monoxide (CO) is an important atmospheric trace gas. In certain "
"urban areas, it is a major atmospheric pollutant. Main sources of CO are "
"combustion of fossil fuels, biomass burning, and atmospheric oxidation of "
"methane and other hydrocarbons. The carbon monoxide total column is "
"measured in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-carbon-monoxide)"
msgstr ""
"### Ugljikov monoksid (CO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ugljikov monoksid (CO) važan je atmosferski plin u tragovima. U određenim "
"urbanim područjima glavni je atmosferski onečišćivač. Glavni izvori CO-a su "
"izgaranje fosilnih goriva, spaljivanje biomase te atmosferska oksidacija "
"metana i drugih ugljikovodika. Ukupni stupac ugljikova monoksida mjeri se u "
"molovima po četvornom metru (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Više informacija "
"[ovdje.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-carbon-monoxide)"

msgid ""
"### Formaldehyde (HCHO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Long term satellite observations of tropospheric formaldehyde (HCHO) are "
"essential to support air quality and chemistry-climate related studies from "
"the regional to the global scale. The seasonal and inter-annual variations "
"of the formaldehyde distribution are principally related to temperature "
"changes and fire events, but also to changes in anthropogenic (human-made) "
"activities. Its lifetime being of the order of a few hours, HCHO "
"concentrations in the boundary layer can be directly related to the release "
"of short-lived hydrocarbons, which mostly cannot be observed directly from "
"space. Measurements are in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-formaldehyde)"
msgstr ""
"### Formaldehid (HCHO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Dugoročna satelitska opažanja troposferskog formaldehida (HCHO) ključna su "
"za potporu studijama kvalitete zraka i odnosa kemije i klime od regionalne "
"do globalne razine. Sezonske i međugodišnje varijacije distribucije "
"formaldehida uglavnom su povezane s promjenama temperature i požarima, ali "
"i s promjenama u antropogenim (ljudskim) aktivnostima. Budući da mu je "
"vijek trajanja reda veličine nekoliko sati, koncentracije HCHO-a u "
"graničnom sloju mogu se izravno povezati s ispuštanjem kratkoživućih "
"ugljikovodika, koji se uglavnom ne mogu izravno opaziti iz svemira. "
"Mjerenja su u molovima po četvornom metru (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Više informacija "
"[ovdje.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-formaldehyde)"

msgid ""
"### Methane (CH4)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Methane is, after carbon dioxide, the most important contributor to the "
"anthropogenically (caused by human activity) enhanced greenhouse effect. "
"Measurements are provided in parts per billion (ppb) with a spatial "
"resolution of 7 km x 3.5 km.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/tropomi-level-2-methane)"
msgstr ""
"### Metan (CH4)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Metan je, nakon ugljikova dioksida, najvažniji čimbenik antropogeno "
"(uzrokovano ljudskom aktivnošću) pojačanog efekta staklenika. Mjerenja se "
"daju u dijelovima na milijardu (ppb) s prostornom razlučivošću od 7 km x "
"3,5 km.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Više informacija "
"[ovdje.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/tropomi-level-2-methane)"

msgid ""
"### Aerosol Index\n"
"\n"
"The Aerosol Index (AI) is a qualitative index indicating the presence of "
"elevated layers of aerosols in the atmosphere. It can be used to detect the "
"presence of UV absorbing aerosols such as desert dust and volcanic ash "
"plumes. Positive values (from light blue to red) indicate the presence of "
"UV-absorbing aerosol. This index is calculated for two pairs of "
"wavelengths: 340/380 nm and 354/388 nm.\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ultraviolet-"
"aerosol-index)"
msgstr ""
"### Indeks aerosola\n"
"\n"
"Indeks aerosola (AI) kvalitativni je indeks koji pokazuje prisutnost "
"povišenih slojeva aerosola u atmosferi. Može se upotrijebiti za otkrivanje "
"prisutnosti aerosola koji apsorbiraju UV, poput pustinjske prašine i oblaka "
"vulkanskog pepela. Pozitivne vrijednosti (od svijetloplave do crvene) "
"označavaju prisutnost aerosola koji apsorbira UV. Ovaj indeks izračunava se "
"za dva para valnih duljina: 340/380 nm i 354/388 nm.\n"
"\n"
"Više informacija "
"[ovdje.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ultraviolet-"
"aerosol-index)"

msgid ""
"### Cloud\n"
"\n"
"The TROPOMI instrument, single payload onboard Sentinel-5 Precursor, "
"retrieves operationally the most important quantities for cloud correction "
"of satellite trace gas retrievals: cloud fraction, cloud optical thickness "
"(albedo), and cloud-top pressure (height). Cloud parameters from TROPOMI "
"are not only used for enhancing the accuracy of trace gas retrievals, but "
"also to extend the satellite data record of cloud information.\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-cloud)."
msgstr ""
"### Oblaci (Cloud)\n"
"\n"
"Instrument TROPOMI, jedini korisni teret na satelitu Sentinel-5 Precursor, "
"operativno određuje najvažnije veličine za korekciju oblaka pri satelitskom "
"određivanju plinova u tragovima: udio oblaka, optičku debljinu oblaka "
"(albedo) i tlak na vrhu oblaka (visinu). Parametri oblaka iz TROPOMI-ja "
"koriste se ne samo za poboljšanje točnosti određivanja plinova u tragovima, "
"već i za produljenje satelitskog zapisa informacija o oblacima.\n"
"\n"
"Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-cloud)."

msgid ""
"**Sentinel-3** mission's main objective is to measure the sea surface "
"topography, the sea and land surface temperature, and the colour of the "
"ocean and land surface. To achieve this goal, Sentinel-3 has a combination "
"of different instruments on board. The most important instruments are the "
"Ocean and Land Colour Instrument (OLCI), the SAR Radar Altimeter (SRAL) and "
"the Sea and Land Surface Temperature Radiometer (SLSTR).\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2016 onwards."
msgstr ""
"Glavni cilj misije **Sentinel-3** je mjerenje topografije površine mora, "
"temperature površine mora i kopna te boje oceana i površine kopna. Za "
"postizanje tog cilja Sentinel-3 nosi kombinaciju različitih instrumenata. "
"Najvažniji instrumenti su Ocean and Land Colour Instrument (OLCI), SAR "
"Radar Altimeter (SRAL) i Sea and Land Surface Temperature Radiometer "
"(SLSTR).\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** od svibnja 2016. nadalje."

msgid ""
"The **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** instrument on board "
"Sentinel-3 measures the global and regional sea and land surface \n"
"temperature. The SLSTR covers the visible, shortwave infrared, and thermal "
"infrared wavelengths of the electromagnetic spectrum. \n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 500m for visible, near- and shortwave infrared "
"wavelengths and 1km for thermal infrared (that is, only details \n"
"bigger than 500m and 1km can be seen, respectively).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 1 day to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2016 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Climate change monitoring, vegetation monitoring, active "
"fire detection, land and sea surface temperature monitoring."
msgstr ""
"Instrument **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** na satelitu "
"Sentinel-3 mjeri globalnu i regionalnu temperaturu površine mora i kopna. \n"
"SLSTR pokriva vidljive, kratkovalne infracrvene i termalne infracrvene "
"valne duljine elektromagnetskog spektra. \n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost:** 500 m za vidljive, bliske i kratkovalne "
"infracrvene valne duljine te 1 km za termalno infracrveno (to jest, vide se "
"samo detalji \n"
"veći od 500 m, odnosno 1 km).\n"
"\n"
"**Vrijeme ponovnog posjeta:** najviše 1 dan za ponovni posjet istog "
"područja, uz korištenje oba satelita.\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** od svibnja 2016. nadalje.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba:** praćenje klimatskih promjena, praćenje vegetacije, "
"otkrivanje aktivnih požara, praćenje temperature površine kopna i mora."

msgid ""
"The **Ocean and Land Colour Instrument (OLCI)** on board Sentinel-3 is a "
"spectrometer that \n"
"measures the solar radiation reflected by Earth, and it monitors the ocean, "
"the environment, \n"
"and climate. It provides more frequent visible imagery than Sentinel-2 but "
"at a lower resolution\n"
"and with more wavelengths covered. The Sentinel-3 OLCI instrument continues "
"the measurements previously performed by the MERIS instrument on board "
"Envisat, whose mission concluded.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 300m (that is, only details bigger than 300m can be "
"seen).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 2 days to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2016 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Surface topography, ocean and land surface colour "
"observations and monitoring."
msgstr ""
"**Ocean and Land Colour Instrument (OLCI)** na satelitu Sentinel-3 je "
"spektrometar koji \n"
"mjeri sunčevo zračenje koje odbija Zemlja te prati oceane, okoliš \n"
"i klimu. Pruža učestalije snimke u vidljivom spektru od Sentinela-2, ali u "
"nižoj razlučivosti\n"
"i s više pokrivenih valnih duljina. Instrument Sentinel-3 OLCI nastavlja "
"mjerenja koja je prethodno provodio instrument MERIS na satelitu Envisat, "
"čija je misija završena.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost:** 300 m (to jest, vide se samo detalji veći od 300 "
"m).\n"
"\n"
"**Vrijeme ponovnog posjeta:** najviše 2 dana za ponovni posjet istog "
"područja, uz korištenje oba satelita.\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** od svibnja 2016. nadalje.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba:** topografija površine, opažanje i praćenje boje "
"površine oceana i kopna."

msgid ""
"**The Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** is a combination of the OLCI and SLSTR "
"acquisitions with original objective to provide surface vegetation "
"products. [The Level-2 "
"SYN](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products) product provides "
"surface reflectances for all SYN channels and aerosol parameters over land.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution**: 300 m  \n"
"\n"
"**Temporal resolution**: < 2 days  \n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: Global since October 2018  \n"
"\n"
"**Common usage**: Land Monitoring and Security, Climate Change Monitoring"
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** je kombinacija snimanja OLCI i SLSTR s izvornim "
"ciljem pružanja proizvoda o površinskoj vegetaciji. [Proizvod razine 2 "
"SYN](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products) pruža površinske "
"refleksije za sve SYN kanale i parametre aerosola iznad kopna.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost**: 300 m  \n"
"\n"
"**Vremenska razlučivost**: < 2 dana  \n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka**: globalno od listopada 2018.  \n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba**: praćenje kopna i sigurnost, praćenje klimatskih "
"promjena"

msgid ""
"**The Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** is a combination of the OLCI and SLSTR "
"acquisitions with original objective to provide surface vegetation "
"products. [The Level-2 "
"VG1](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products) product "
"contains 1 km VEGETATION-like product, 1 day synthesis surface reflectances "
"and NDVI.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Temporal resolution**: Daily\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: Global since October 2018\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage**: Land Monitoring and Security, Climate Change Monitoring"
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** je kombinacija snimanja OLCI i SLSTR s izvornim "
"ciljem pružanja proizvoda o površinskoj vegetaciji. [Proizvod razine 2 "
"VG1](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products) sadrži "
"proizvod sličan VEGETATION razlučivosti 1 km, jednodnevnu sintezu "
"površinskih refleksija i NDVI.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Vremenska razlučivost**: dnevno\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka**: globalno od listopada 2018.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba**: praćenje kopna i sigurnost, praćenje klimatskih "
"promjena"

msgid ""
"**The Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** is a combination of the OLCI and SLSTR "
"acquisitions with original objective to provide surface vegetation "
"products. [The Level-2 "
"V10](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products) product "
"contains 1 km VEGETATION-like product, 10 day synthesis surface "
"reflectances and NDVI.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Temporal resolution**: 10-days composite\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: Global since October 2018\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage**: Land Monitoring and Security, Climate Change Monitoring"
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** je kombinacija snimanja OLCI i SLSTR s izvornim "
"ciljem pružanja proizvoda o površinskoj vegetaciji. [Proizvod razine 2 "
"V10](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products) sadrži "
"proizvod sličan VEGETATION razlučivosti 1 km, desetodnevnu sintezu "
"površinskih refleksija i NDVI.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Vremenska razlučivost**: desetodnevni kompozit\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka**: globalno od listopada 2018.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba**: praćenje kopna i sigurnost, praćenje klimatskih "
"promjena"

msgid ""
"The **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** instrument on board "
"Sentinel-3 measures the global and regional sea and land surface "
"temperature. The SLSTR L2 Land Surface Temperature (LST) product provides "
"land surface temperature retrieved from the thermal infrared channels.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 1km (that is, only details bigger than 1km can be "
"seen).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 1 day to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2018 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Climate change monitoring, land surface temperature "
"monitoring, drought monitoring, urban heat island studies."
msgstr ""
"Instrument **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** na satelitu "
"Sentinel-3 mjeri globalnu i regionalnu temperaturu površine mora i kopna. "
"Proizvod SLSTR L2 Land Surface Temperature (LST) pruža temperaturu površine "
"kopna dobivenu iz termalnih infracrvenih kanala.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost:** 1 km (to jest, vide se samo detalji veći od 1 "
"km).\n"
"\n"
"**Vrijeme ponovnog posjeta:** najviše 1 dan za ponovni posjet istog "
"područja, uz korištenje oba satelita.\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** od svibnja 2018. nadalje.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba:** praćenje klimatskih promjena, praćenje temperature "
"površine kopna, praćenje suše, studije urbanih toplinskih otoka."

msgid ""
"**Sentinel-2** provides high-resolution images in the visible and infrared "
"wavelengths, to monitor vegetation, soil and water cover, inland waterways "
"and coastal areas.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 10m, 20m, and 60m, depending on the wavelength "
"(that is, only details bigger than 10m, 20m, and 60m can be seen). More "
"info "
"[here](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/user-guides/sentinel-2-msi/"
"resolutions/spatial). \n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** maximum 5 days to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since June 2015. Full global coverage since March "
"2017.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Land-cover maps, land-change detection maps, vegetation "
"monitoring, monitoring of burnt areas."
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-2** pruža slike visoke razlučivosti u vidljivim i infracrvenim "
"valnim duljinama za praćenje vegetacije, tla i vodenog pokrova, unutarnjih "
"plovnih putova i obalnih područja.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost:** 10 m, 20 m i 60 m, ovisno o valnoj duljini (to "
"jest, vide se samo detalji veći od 10 m, 20 m i 60 m). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/user-guides/sentinel-2-msi/"
"resolutions/spatial). \n"
"\n"
"**Vrijeme ponovnog posjeta:** najviše 5 dana za ponovni posjet istog "
"područja, uz korištenje oba satelita.\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** od lipnja 2015. Potpuna globalna pokrivenost od "
"ožujka 2017.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba:** karte pokrova zemljišta, karte otkrivanja promjena "
"zemljišta, praćenje vegetacije, praćenje opožarenih površina."

msgid ""
"Level 2A data are high quality data where the effects of the atmosphere on "
"the light being reflected off of the surface of the Earth and reaching the "
"sensor are excluded. Data are available globally since March 2017.\n"
"\n"
"More info about atmospheric correction "
"[here](https://www.sentinel-hub.com/develop/api/ogc/custom-parameters/"
"atmospheric-correction/)."
msgstr ""
"Podaci razine 2A su visokokvalitetni podaci u kojima su isključeni učinci "
"atmosfere na svjetlost koja se odbija od Zemljine površine i dolazi do "
"senzora. Podaci su dostupni globalno od ožujka 2017.\n"
"\n"
"Više informacija o atmosferskoj korekciji "
"[ovdje](https://www.sentinel-hub.com/develop/api/ogc/custom-parameters/"
"atmospheric-correction/)."

msgid ""
"Level 1C data are data of sufficient quality for most investigations, where "
"all image corrections were done except for the atmospheric correction. Data "
"are available globally since June 2015 onwards."
msgstr ""
"Podaci razine 1C su podaci dovoljne kvalitete za većinu istraživanja, u "
"kojima su provedene sve korekcije slike osim atmosferske korekcije. Podaci "
"su dostupni globalno od lipnja 2015. nadalje."

msgid ""
"**Sentinel-1** provides all-weather, day and night radar imagery for land "
"and ocean services. EO\n"
"Browser provides data acquired in Interferometric Wide Swath (IW) and Extra "
"Wide Swath (EW) modes\n"
"processed to Level-1 Ground Range Detected (GRD).\n"
"\n"
"**Pixel spacing:** 10m (IW), 40m (EW).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** <= 5 days using both satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time** (for asc/desc and overlap using both satellites): <= 3 "
"days, see [observation "
"scenario](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/missions/sentinel-1/"
"observation-scenario)\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since October 2014.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Maritime and land monitoring, emergency response, climate "
"change."
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-1** pruža radarske snimke za usluge kopna i oceana neovisno o "
"vremenskim uvjetima, danju i noću. EO\n"
"Browser pruža podatke snimljene u načinima Interferometric Wide Swath (IW) "
"i Extra Wide Swath (EW)\n"
"obrađene do razine 1 Ground Range Detected (GRD).\n"
"\n"
"**Razmak piksela:** 10 m (IW), 40 m (EW).\n"
"\n"
"**Vrijeme ponovnog posjeta:** <= 5 dana uz korištenje oba satelita.\n"
"\n"
"**Vrijeme ponovnog posjeta** (za uzlazne/silazne orbite i preklapanje uz "
"korištenje oba satelita): <= 3 dana, pogledajte [scenarij "
"opažanja](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/missions/sentinel-1/"
"observation-scenario)\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** od listopada 2014.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba:** pomorski nadzor i nadzor kopna, hitno djelovanje, "
"klimatske promjene."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics** is a monthly composite obtained by "
"computing the local resolution weighted average of radiometrically and "
"geometrically terrain corrected input scenes. Due to the use of all "
"available data in a month, it contains less speckle (temporal average) and "
"the best possible local resolution (combination of ascending and descending "
"orbits).\n"
"\n"
"The input for the Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics are scenes with DH "
"polarization and can come from all acquisition modes.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Primarily polar and near-polar areas, as well as "
"ocean-relevant areas\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"The data for each month is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding month (e.g. 1.1. or 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** ~40 meters."
msgstr ""
"**Mjesečni mozaici Sentinel-1 DH** su mjesečni kompozit dobiven izračunom "
"lokalnog prosjeka ponderiranog razlučivošću radiometrijski i geometrijski "
"terenski korigiranih ulaznih scena. Zbog korištenja svih dostupnih podataka "
"u mjesecu sadrži manje šuma (speckle) (vremenski prosjek) i najbolju moguću "
"lokalnu razlučivost (kombinacija uzlaznih i silaznih orbita).\n"
"\n"
"Ulaz za mjesečne mozaike Sentinel-1 DH su scene s DH polarizacijom koje "
"mogu dolaziti iz svih načina snimanja.\n"
"\n"
"**Pokrivenost:** prvenstveno polarna i gotovo polarna područja te područja "
"relevantna za oceane\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Podaci za svaki mjesec dostupni su u katalogu 1. dana odgovarajućeg mjeseca "
"(npr. 1.1. ili 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost:** ~40 metara."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics** is a monthly composite obtained by "
"computing the local resolution weighted average of radiometrically and "
"geometrically terrain corrected input scenes. Due to the use of all "
"available data in a month, it contains less speckle (temporal average) and "
"the best possible local resolution (combination of ascending and descending "
"orbits).\n"
"\n"
"The input for the Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics are scenes taken in the IW "
"acquisition mode with DV polarization.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Over land and coastal areas (mainly between 80°N and 56°S)\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"The data for each month is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding month (e.g. 1.1. or 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** ~20 meters."
msgstr ""
"**Mjesečni mozaici Sentinel-1 IW** su mjesečni kompozit dobiven izračunom "
"lokalnog prosjeka ponderiranog razlučivošću radiometrijski i geometrijski "
"terenski korigiranih ulaznih scena. Zbog korištenja svih dostupnih podataka "
"u mjesecu sadrži manje šuma (speckle) (vremenski prosjek) i najbolju moguću "
"lokalnu razlučivost (kombinacija uzlaznih i silaznih orbita).\n"
"\n"
"Ulaz za mjesečne mozaike Sentinel-1 IW su scene snimljene u načinu snimanja "
"IW s DV polarizacijom.\n"
"\n"
"**Pokrivenost:** iznad kopna i obalnih područja (uglavnom između 80°N i "
"56°S)\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Podaci za svaki mjesec dostupni su u katalogu 1. dana odgovarajućeg mjeseca "
"(npr. 1.1. ili 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost:** ~20 metara."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **WorldCover Annual Cloudless Mosaics** product offers an almost "
"cloud-free image over the entire globe, created by stitching together the "
"cloudless Sentinel-2 images acquired over a one-year period at a spatial "
"resolution of 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"More information can be found "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/SentinelMissions/"
"Sentinel2.html#sentinel-2-level-2a-worldcover-annual-cloudless-mosaic-"
"rgbnir).\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Global Coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Data for each year is available in the catalog on the 1.1. of the "
"corresponding year.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Creating Basemaps, Land cover classification, "
"Infrastructure/Land use planning, Environmental monitoring, Water resource "
"management and more."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod **WorldCover godišnji mozaici bez oblaka** nudi gotovo bezoblačnu "
"sliku cijelog globusa, nastalu spajanjem bezoblačnih snimki Sentinel-2 "
"prikupljenih tijekom jednogodišnjeg razdoblja u prostornoj razlučivosti od "
"10 metara.\n"
"\n"
"Više informacija možete pronaći "
"[ovdje](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/SentinelMissions/"
"Sentinel2.html#sentinel-2-level-2a-worldcover-annual-cloudless-mosaic-"
"rgbnir).\n"
"\n"
"**Pokrivenost:** globalna pokrivenost.\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Podaci za svaku godinu dostupni su u katalogu 1.1. odgovarajuće godine.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost:** 10 metara.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba:** izrada podloga, klasifikacija pokrova zemljišta, "
"planiranje infrastrukture/namjene zemljišta, praćenje okoliša, upravljanje "
"vodnim resursima i više."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-2 Quarterly Mosaics** product offers an almost cloud-free "
"image over the entire globe, created by stitching together the cloudless "
"Sentinel-2 images acquired over a quarterly period (every 3 months) at a "
"spatial resolution of 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Global Coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Data for each quarter is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding quarter (e.g. 1.1. or 1.4.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Creating Basemaps, Land cover classification, "
"Infrastructure/Land use planning, Environmental monitoring, Water resource "
"management and more."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod **Sentinel-2 tromjesečni mozaici** nudi gotovo bezoblačnu sliku "
"cijelog globusa, nastalu spajanjem bezoblačnih snimki Sentinel-2 "
"prikupljenih tijekom tromjesečnog razdoblja (svaka 3 mjeseca) u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od 10 metara.\n"
"\n"
"**Pokrivenost:** globalna pokrivenost.\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Podaci za svako tromjesečje dostupni su u katalogu 1. dana odgovarajućeg "
"tromjesečja (npr. 1.1. ili 1.4.).\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost:** 10 metara.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba:** izrada podloga, klasifikacija pokrova zemljišta, "
"planiranje infrastrukture/namjene zemljišta, praćenje okoliša, upravljanje "
"vodnim resursima i više."

msgid "General complementary data information."
msgstr "Opće informacije o komplementarnim podacima."

msgid ""
"The **Landsat 8-9** collection contains imagery from the two most recently "
"launched Landsat satellites (Landsat 8 and Landsat 9, provided by "
"NASA/USGS). Both carry the Operational Land Imager (OLI) and the Thermal "
"Infrared Sensor (TIRS), with 9 optical and 2 thermal bands. These two "
"sensors provide seasonal coverage of the global landmass.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 15 m for the panchromatic band and 30 m for the "
"rest (the thermal bands are re-sampled from 100 m).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** 16 days\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since January 2021\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Vegetation monitoring, land use, land cover maps, change "
"monitoring, etc.\n"
"\n"
"**Level-1** data (from **Landsat Collection 2**) provides global top of the "
"atmosphere reflectance and top of the atmosphere brightness temperature "
"products. \n"
"  \n"
"The data underwent several processing steps including geometric and "
"radiometric improvements. \n"
"  \n"
"More info about Level-1 data "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/SentinelHub/Data/"
"Landsat8-9.html)."
msgstr ""
"Kolekcija **Landsat 8-9** sadrži snimke s dva posljednja lansirana satelita "
"Landsat (Landsat 8 i Landsat 9, koje pruža NASA/USGS). Oba nose Operational "
"Land Imager (OLI) i Thermal Infrared Sensor (TIRS), s 9 optičkih i 2 "
"termalna pojasa. Ta dva senzora pružaju sezonsku pokrivenost globalnog "
"kopna.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost:** 15 m za pankromatski pojas i 30 m za ostale "
"(termalni pojasevi ponovno su uzorkovani iz 100 m).\n"
"\n"
"**Vrijeme ponovnog posjeta:** 16 dana\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka:** od siječnja 2021.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba:** praćenje vegetacije, namjena zemljišta, karte "
"pokrova zemljišta, praćenje promjena itd.\n"
"\n"
"Podaci **razine 1** (iz **Landsat Collection 2**) pružaju globalne "
"proizvode refleksije na vrhu atmosfere i svjetlinske temperature na vrhu "
"atmosfere. \n"
"  \n"
"Podaci su prošli nekoliko koraka obrade, uključujući geometrijska i "
"radiometrijska poboljšanja. \n"
"  \n"
"Više informacija o podacima razine 1 "
"[ovdje](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/SentinelHub/Data/"
"Landsat8-9.html)."

msgid ""
"Global, cloud-free, and reconstructed historical Landsat spectral bands are "
"provided at a spatial resolution of 30 meters and temporal resolution of "
"bimonthly intervals from 1997 onwards. The dataset was generated using the "
"GLAD Landsat ARD version 2 as the primary input for temporal aggregation "
"and the imputation of missing values."
msgstr ""
"Globalni, bezoblačni i rekonstruirani povijesni spektralni pojasevi "
"Landsata pružaju se u prostornoj razlučivosti od 30 metara i vremenskoj "
"razlučivosti od dvomjesečnih intervala od 1997. nadalje. Skup podataka "
"generiran je pomoću GLAD Landsat ARD verzije 2 kao primarnog ulaza za "
"vremensku agregaciju i imputaciju nedostajućih vrijednosti."

msgid ""
"A **DEM** (Digital Elevation Model) is a digital representation of a "
"terrain (usually Earth's surface). It is obtained by dividing the whole "
"globe into grid cells, each holding a corresponding altitude value in "
"meters. Depending on the gride cell size, a DEM can be more detailed (high "
"resolution) or less detailed (low resolution). Sentinel Hub DEM data "
"collections are static (independent of date) and globally available.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Modelling water flows, orthorectification of Sentinel-1 "
"imagery and engineering."
msgstr ""
"**DEM** (Digital Elevation Model, digitalni model visina) je digitalni "
"prikaz terena (obično Zemljine površine). Dobiva se podjelom cijelog "
"globusa na ćelije mreže, od kojih svaka sadrži odgovarajuću vrijednost "
"visine u metrima. Ovisno o veličini ćelije mreže, DEM može biti detaljniji "
"(visoka razlučivost) ili manje detaljan (niska razlučivost). Kolekcije "
"podataka Sentinel Hub DEM statične su (neovisne o datumu) i globalno "
"dostupne.\n"
"\n"
"**Uobičajena uporaba:** modeliranje tokova vode, ortorektifikacija snimki "
"Sentinel-1 i inženjerstvo."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Copernicus DEM** represents the surface of the Earth including "
"buildings, infrastructure and vegetation. Similar to the Mapzen DEM, it is "
"based on a combination of different DEMs (basis "
"[WorldDEMTM](https://www.geospatialworld.net/article/worlddemtm-new-"
"standard-of-global-elevation-models/)). It is a static collection "
"(independent of date) with global coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 30 m infilled with 90 m (where 30 m tiles are not "
"released).\n"
"\n"
"Credits: [ESA](${ COPERNICUS_CREDITS_URL })"
msgstr ""
"**Copernicus DEM** predstavlja površinu Zemlje uključujući zgrade, "
"infrastrukturu i vegetaciju. Slično kao Mapzen DEM, temelji se na "
"kombinaciji različitih DEM-ova (osnova "
"[WorldDEMTM](https://www.geospatialworld.net/article/worlddemtm-new-"
"standard-of-global-elevation-models/)). To je statična kolekcija (neovisna "
"o datumu) s globalnom pokrivenošću.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorna razlučivost:** 30 m popunjeno s 90 m (gdje pločice od 30 m nisu "
"objavljene).\n"
"\n"
"Zaslužni: [ESA](${ COPERNICUS_CREDITS_URL })"

