"podataka PROBA-V s verzijom 1.0 te od srpnja 2020. nadalje na temelju "
"podataka Sentinel-3/OLCI s verzijom 1.1. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-dry-matter-"
"productivity-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides the Long-Term Statistics of the Normalized Difference Vegetation "
"Index. Every 10-days, minimum, median, maximum and mean are available at "
"global scale, at a spatial resolution of ~1km over the 21-years period "
"1999-2019. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-long-term-statistics-v3-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža dugoročne statistike normaliziranog diferencijalnog indeksa "
"vegetacije. Svakih 10 dana dostupni su minimum, medijan, maksimum i srednja "
"vrijednost na globalnoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti od ~1 km tijekom "
"21-godišnjeg razdoblja 1999.-2019. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-long-term-statistics-v3-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Normalized Difference Vegetation Index (NDVI) is an indicator of the "
"greenness of the biomes. Every 10-days estimates are available at global "
"scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from 2014 to June 2020. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalized-"
"difference-vegetation-index-300m-v1.0)."
msgstr ""
"Normalizirani diferencijalni indeks vegetacije (NDVI) pokazatelj je "
"zelenila biomâ. Procjene svakih 10 dana dostupne su na globalnoj razini u "
"prostornoj razlučivosti od oko 300 m od 2014. do lipnja 2020. Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalized-"
"difference-vegetation-index-300m-v1.0)."

msgid ""
"Provides information on the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, a "
"spectral index quantifying the amount and vigour of vegetation. Every "
"10-days, estimates are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution "
"of ~300m. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža informacije o normaliziranom diferencijalnom indeksu vegetacije, "
"spektralnom indeksu koji kvantificira količinu i snagu vegetacije. Svakih "
"10 dana procjene su dostupne na globalnoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti "
"od ~300 m. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information on the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, a "
"spectral index quantifying the amount and vigour of vegetation. Every "
"10-days, estimates are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution "
"of ~300m. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža informacije o normaliziranom diferencijalnom indeksu vegetacije, "
"spektralnom indeksu koji kvantificira količinu i snagu vegetacije. Svakih "
"10 dana procjene su dostupne na globalnoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti "
"od ~300 m. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information on the relative water content of the top few "
"centimeters soil, describing how wet or dry the soil is in its topmost "
"layer, expressed in percent saturation. Daily observations are available "
"for the continental Europe in the spatial resolution of 1 km and with the "
"temporal extent from October 2014 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-surface-"
"soil-moisture-v1.0)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža informacije o relativnom sadržaju vode u gornjih nekoliko centimetara "
"tla, opisujući koliko je tlo vlažno ili suho u najgornjem sloju, izraženo u "
"postotku zasićenosti. Dnevna opažanja dostupna su za kontinentalnu Europu u "
"prostornoj razlučivosti od 1 km i s vremenskim obuhvatom od listopada 2014. "
"do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-surface-"
"soil-moisture-v1.0)."

msgid ""
"Maps burn scars, surfaces which have been sufficiently affected by fire to "
"display significant changes in the vegetation cover (destruction of dry "
"material, reduction or loss of green material) and in the ground surface "
"(temporarily darker because of ash). Monthly datasets are available at "
"global scale, in the spatial resolution of 300 m, and with a time lag of "
"two months. They cover the period from 2019 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/burnt-area-v3-1-"
"monthly-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Kartira opožarene površine, površine koje je požar dovoljno zahvatio da "
"pokazuju značajne promjene u vegetacijskom pokrovu (uništenje suhog "
"materijala, smanjenje ili gubitak zelenog materijala) i na površini tla "
"(privremeno tamnije zbog pepela). Mjesečni skupovi podataka dostupni su na "
"globalnoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti od 300 m i s vremenskim "
"zakašnjenjem od dva mjeseca. Pokrivaju razdoblje od 2019. do 2025. Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/burnt-area-v3-1-"
"monthly-300m)."

msgid ""
"Maps burn scars, surfaces which have been sufficiently affected by fire to "
"display significant changes in the vegetation cover (destruction of dry "
"material, reduction or loss of green material) and in the ground surface "
"(temporarily darker because of ash). Monthly datasets are available at "
"global scale, in the spatial resolution of 300 m, and with a time lag of "
"two months. They cover the period from July 2018 to present. More "
"information _coming soon_."
msgstr ""
"Kartira opožarene površine, površine koje je požar dovoljno zahvatio da "
"pokazuju značajne promjene u vegetacijskom pokrovu (uništenje suhog "
"materijala, smanjenje ili gubitak zelenog materijala) i na površini tla "
"(privremeno tamnije zbog pepela). Mjesečni skupovi podataka dostupni su na "
"globalnoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti od 300 m i s vremenskim "
"zakašnjenjem od dva mjeseca. Pokrivaju razdoblje od srpnja 2018. do danas. "
"Više informacija _uskoro_."

msgid ""
"Maps burn scars, surfaces which have been sufficiently affected by fire to "
"display significant changes in the vegetation cover (destruction of dry "
"material, reduction or loss of green material) and in the ground surface "
"(temporarily darker because of ash). Daily datasets are available at global "
"scale, in the spatial resolution of 300 m, and within 24 hours after the "
"satellite acquisition. They cover the period from July 2023 to 2025. More "
"info "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/burnt-area-v3-1-"
"daily-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Kartira opožarene površine, površine koje je požar dovoljno zahvatio da "
"pokazuju značajne promjene u vegetacijskom pokrovu (uništenje suhog "
"materijala, smanjenje ili gubitak zelenog materijala) i na površini tla "
"(privremeno tamnije zbog pepela). Dnevni skupovi podataka dostupni su na "
"globalnoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti od 300 m i unutar 24 sata nakon "
"satelitskog snimanja. Pokrivaju razdoblje od srpnja 2023. do 2025. Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/burnt-area-v3-1-"
"daily-300m)."

msgid ""
"Maps burn scars, surfaces which have been sufficiently affected by fire to "
"display significant changes in the vegetation cover (destruction of dry "
"material, reduction or loss of green material) and in the ground surface "
"(temporarily darker because of ash). Daily datasets are available at global "
"scale, in the spatial resolution of 300 m, and within 24 hours after the "
"satellite acquisition. They cover the period from December 2024 to present. "
"More information _coming soon_."
msgstr ""
"Kartira opožarene površine, površine koje je požar dovoljno zahvatio da "
"pokazuju značajne promjene u vegetacijskom pokrovu (uništenje suhog "
"materijala, smanjenje ili gubitak zelenog materijala) i na površini tla "
"(privremeno tamnije zbog pepela). Dnevni skupovi podataka dostupni su na "
"globalnoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti od 300 m i unutar 24 sata nakon "
"satelitskog snimanja. Pokrivaju razdoblje od prosinca 2024. do danas. Više "
"informacija _uskoro_."

msgid ""
"Provide at global scale and for Europe information on vegetation phenology "
"and productivity gathering 13 parameters  for two growing seasons. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža na globalnoj razini i za Europu informacije o fenologiji i "
"produktivnosti vegetacije koje obuhvaćaju 13 parametara za dvije "
"vegetacijske sezone. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."

msgid ""
"Provides at global scale and for Europe information on vegetation phenology "
"and productivity gathering 13 parameters for two growing seasons. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža na globalnoj razini i za Europu informacije o fenologiji i "
"produktivnosti vegetacije koje obuhvaćaju 13 parametara za dvije "
"vegetacijske sezone. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."

msgid ""
"Provides the total amount of carbon compounds produced by photosynthesis of "
"plants in an ecosystem in a given period of time. 10-daily observations are "
"available at global scale in the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the "
"temporal extent from 2023 to 2026. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža ukupnu količinu ugljikovih spojeva proizvedenih fotosintezom biljaka "
"u ekosustavu u zadanom vremenskom razdoblju. 10-dnevna opažanja dostupna su "
"na globalnoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od 300 m i s vremenskim "
"obuhvatom od 2023. do 2026. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Defined as half the total area of green elements of the canopy per unit "
"horizontal ground area. Every 10-days estimates are available in near real "
"time at global scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from January "
"2014 to June 2020 based upon PROBA-V data with version 1.0 and from July "
"2020 onwards based upon Sentinel-3/OLCI data with version 1.1. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-300"
"m-v1.0)."
msgstr ""
"Definiran kao polovica ukupne površine zelenih elemenata krošnje po "
"jedinici vodoravne površine tla. Procjene svakih 10 dana dostupne su gotovo "
"u stvarnom vremenu na globalnoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od oko 300 "
"m od siječnja 2014. do lipnja 2020. na temelju podataka PROBA-V s verzijom "
"1.0 te od srpnja 2020. nadalje na temelju podataka Sentinel-3/OLCI s "
"verzijom 1.1. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-30"
"0m-v1.0)."

msgid ""
"Defined as half the total area of green elements of the canopy per unit "
"horizontal ground area. Every 10-days estimates are available in near real "
"time at global scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from January "
"2014 to June 2020 based upon PROBA-V data with version 1.0 and from July "
"2020 to 2026 based upon Sentinel-3/OLCI data with version 1.1. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-300"
"m-v1.0)."
msgstr ""
"Definiran kao polovica ukupne površine zelenih elemenata krošnje po "
"jedinici vodoravne površine tla. Procjene svakih 10 dana dostupne su gotovo "
"u stvarnom vremenu na globalnoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od oko 300 "
"m od siječnja 2014. do lipnja 2020. na temelju podataka PROBA-V s verzijom "
"1.0 te od srpnja 2020. do 2026. na temelju podataka Sentinel-3/OLCI s "
"verzijom 1.1. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-30"
"0m-v1.0)."

msgid ""
"Provides the amount of carbon retained in an ecosystem (increase in "
"biomass); it is equal to the difference between the amount of carbon "
"produced through photosynthesis (GPP) and the amount of energy that is used "
"for respiration (R). 10-daily observations are available at global scale in "
"the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the temporal extent from 2023 to "
"2026. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža količinu ugljika zadržanog u ekosustavu (povećanje biomase); jednaka "
"je razlici između količine ugljika proizvedenog fotosintezom (GPP) i "
"količine energije koja se koristi za disanje (R). 10-dnevna opažanja "
"dostupna su na globalnoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od 300 m i s "
"vremenskim obuhvatom od 2023. do 2026. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, a spectral index "
"quantifying the amount and vigour of vegetation. Every 10-days, estimates "
"are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution of ~1km from January "
"1999 to June 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža normalizirani diferencijalni indeks vegetacije, spektralni indeks "
"koji kvantificira količinu i snagu vegetacije. Svakih 10 dana procjene su "
"dostupne na globalnoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti od ~1 km od "
"siječnja 1999. do lipnja 2020. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Averages the daily Soil Water Index product over 10 days. The data are "
"produced every 10 days over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."
msgstr ""
"Usrednjava dnevni proizvod indeksa vode u tlu tijekom 10 dana. Podaci se "
"proizvode svakih 10 dana za cijeli globus u prostornoj razlučivosti od 0,1° "
"i s vremenskim obuhvatom od siječnja 2007. do 2025. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."

msgid ""
"Provides daily updates on the moisture conditions in different soil layers. "
"The data are available over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža dnevna ažuriranja uvjeta vlažnosti u različitim slojevima tla. Podaci "
"su dostupni za cijeli globus u prostornoj razlučivosti od 0,1° i s "
"vremenskim obuhvatom od siječnja 2007. do 2025. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5km)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the moisture condition at various depths in the soil. Daily "
"observations are available for the continental Europe in the spatial "
"resolution of 1 km and with the temporal extent from January 2015 to 2025. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Kvantificira stanje vlažnosti na različitim dubinama u tlu. Dnevna opažanja "
"dostupna su za kontinentalnu Europu u prostornoj razlučivosti od 1 km i s "
"vremenskim obuhvatom od siječnja 2015. do 2025. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-v1-0-1km)."

#. LOT2
msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water providing the maximum and the "
"minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal dynamics. "
"10-daly data are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of 300 "
"m and with the temporal extent from 2014 to 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Otkriva područja prekrivena kopnenim vodama, pružajući maksimalni i "
"minimalni opseg vodene površine te sezonsku dinamiku. 10-dnevni podaci "
"dostupni su na globalnoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od 300 m i s "
"vremenskim obuhvatom od 2014. do 2020. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water providing the maximum and the "
"minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal dynamics. "
"Monthly updates are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of "
"300 m and with the temporal extent from 2020 to present More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Otkriva područja prekrivena kopnenim vodama, pružajući maksimalni i "
"minimalni opseg vodene površine te sezonsku dinamiku. Mjesečna ažuriranja "
"dostupna su na globalnoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od 300 m i s "
"vremenskim obuhvatom od 2020. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides for the Northern Hemisphere daily updates of the equivalent amount "
"of liquid water stored in the snow pack. The data is available in the "
"spatial resolution of 5 km and with the temporal extent from January 2006 "
"to June 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v1-"
"0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža za Sjevernu hemisferu dnevna ažuriranja ekvivalentne količine tekuće "
"vode pohranjene u snježnom pokrivaču. Podaci su dostupni u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od 5 km i s vremenskim obuhvatom od siječnja 2006. do lipnja "
"2024. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v1"
"-0-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for the Northern Hemisphere daily updates of the equivalent amount "
"of liquid water stored in the snow pack. The data is available in near real "
"time in the spatial resolution of 5 km and with the temporal extent from "
"July 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v2-"
"0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža za Sjevernu hemisferu dnevna ažuriranja ekvivalentne količine tekuće "
"vode pohranjene u snježnom pokrivaču. Podaci su dostupni gotovo u stvarnom "
"vremenu u prostornoj razlučivosti od 5 km i s vremenskim obuhvatom od "
"srpnja 2024. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v2"
"-0-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for Europe daily updates of the fraction of snow cover on the "
"ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%). The "
"data is available in near real time in the spatial resolution of 500 m and "
"with the temporal extent from March 2017 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-europe-"
"v1-0-500m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža za Europu dnevna ažuriranja udjela snježnog pokrova na tlu (i u "
"šumskim područjima) po pikselu u postocima (0 % – 100 %). Podaci su "
"dostupni gotovo u stvarnom vremenu u prostornoj razlučivosti od 500 m i s "
"vremenskim obuhvatom od ožujka 2017. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-"
"europe-v1-0-500m)."

msgid ""
"Provides for Northern Hemisphere daily maps of the fraction of snow cover "
"on ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%). The "
"data is available in near real time with a pixel spacing of about 1 km and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2018 to 2026. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža za Sjevernu hemisferu dnevne karte udjela snježnog pokrova na tlu (i "
"u šumskim područjima) po pikselu u postocima (0 % – 100 %). Podaci su "
"dostupni gotovo u stvarnom vremenu s razmakom piksela od oko 1 km i s "
"vremenskim obuhvatom od siječnja 2018. do 2026. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-v1-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for global land areas (excluding Antarctica) daily maps of the "
"fraction of snow cover on ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in "
"percentage (0% – 100%). The data is available in near real time with a "
"pixel spacing of about 1 km and with the temporal extent from December 2025 "
"to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-global-v1-0-1"
"km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža za globalna kopnena područja (osim Antarktike) dnevne karte udjela "
"snježnog pokrova na tlu (i u šumskim područjima) po pikselu u postocima (0 "
"% – 100 %). Podaci su dostupni gotovo u stvarnom vremenu s razmakom piksela "
"od oko 1 km i s vremenskim obuhvatom od prosinca 2025. do danas. Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-global-v1-0-1"
"km)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis classifies pixels in Northern Hemisphere freshwater bodies "
"into 1) Ice, 2) Open water, and 3) Cloud. The class “Ice” includes various "
"types of ice, also snow-covered ice. The data is updated in near real-time "
"with the spatial resolution of 500 m and with a temporal extent from April "
"2021 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-500m)."
msgstr ""
"Svakodnevno klasificira piksele u slatkovodnim tijelima Sjeverne hemisfere "
"u 1) led, 2) otvorenu vodu i 3) oblak. Klasa „led” uključuje razne vrste "
"leda, također led prekriven snijegom. Podaci se ažuriraju gotovo u stvarnom "
"vremenu u prostornoj razlučivosti od 500 m i s vremenskim obuhvatom od "
"travnja 2021. do 2025. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-500m)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis, classifies pixels of Continental Europe freshwater bodies "
"as 1) Fully snow-covered ice, 2) Partially snow-covered or snow-free ice, "
"and 3) Open water. The data is available in near real time in a spatial "
"resolution of 250 m and with the temporal extent from July the 1st, "
"onwards. In June 2024, the data input sensor was transferred from Terra "
"MODIS (VERSION 1.2.1) to NOAA-20 VIIRS (VERSION 2.2.1), and the area was "
"extended from the Baltic region to cover Continental Europe. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"europe-v2-250m)."
msgstr ""
"Svakodnevno klasificira piksele u slatkovodnim tijelima kontinentalne "
"Europe u 1) led potpuno prekriven snijegom, 2) led djelomično prekriven "
"snijegom ili bez snijega i 3) otvorenu vodu. Podaci su dostupni gotovo u "
"stvarnom vremenu u prostornoj razlučivosti od 250 m i s vremenskim "
"obuhvatom od 1. srpnja nadalje. U lipnju 2024. ulazni senzor podataka "
"prebačen je s Terra MODIS (VERZIJA 1.2.1) na NOAA-20 VIIRS (VERZIJA 2.2.1), "
"a područje je prošireno s baltičke regije na cijelu kontinentalnu Europu. "
"Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"europe-v2-250m)."

msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water along the year providing the "
"maximum and the minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal "
"dynamics. Monthly updates are available at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of 100 m and with the temporal extent from 2020 to present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Otkriva područja prekrivena kopnenim vodama tijekom godine, pružajući "
"maksimalni i minimalni opseg vodene površine te sezonsku dinamiku. Mjesečna "
"ažuriranja dostupna su na globalnoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od 100 "
"m i s vremenskim obuhvatom od 2020. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes. 10-daily observations are available in near real time at "
"300 m spatial resolution from September 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-near-real-time-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža poluneprekidna opažanja za velik broj srednjih i velikih jezera. "
"10-dnevna opažanja dostupna su gotovo u stvarnom vremenu u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od 300 m od rujna 2024. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-near-real-time-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the "
"temporal extent from 2002 to 2012. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža poluneprekidna opažanja za velik broj srednjih i velikih jezera, "
"prema Global Lakes and Wetlands Database (GLWD) ili inače od posebnog "
"interesa za praćenje okoliša. 10-dnevna opažanja dostupna su u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od 300 m i s vremenskim obuhvatom od 2002. do 2012. Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the "
"temporal extent from 2016 to 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža poluneprekidna opažanja za velik broj srednjih i velikih jezera, "
"prema Global Lakes and Wetlands Database (GLWD) ili inače od posebnog "
"interesa za praćenje okoliša. 10-dnevna opažanja dostupna su u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od 300 m i s vremenskim obuhvatom od 2016. do 2024. Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in near real time in the spatial resolution of "
"100 m and with the temporal extent from 2019 to 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v1-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža poluneprekidna opažanja za velik broj srednjih i velikih jezera, "
"prema Global Lakes and Wetlands Database (GLWD) ili inače od posebnog "
"interesa za praćenje okoliša. 10-dnevna opažanja dostupna su gotovo u "
"stvarnom vremenu u prostornoj razlučivosti od 100 m i s vremenskim "
"obuhvatom od 2019. do 2024. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v1-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides spatial information at global level on different types (classes) "
"of physical coverage of the Earth's surface, e.g. forests, grasslands, "
"croplands, water bodies, wetlands for the base year 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products?tab=full_coverage_land_cover__"
"use)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža prostorne informacije na globalnoj razini o različitim vrstama "
"(klasama) fizičkog pokrova Zemljine površine, npr. šume, travnjaci, "
"obradive površine, vodna tijela, močvare za baznu 2020. godinu. Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products?tab=full_coverage_land_cover_"
"_use)."

msgid ""
"Provides yearly tree cover density for the pantropical region at 10 m "
"resolution, expressed as percentage of tree cover. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover/"
"tree-cover-density-2020-raster-10-m-pantropical-annual)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža godišnju gustoću pokrova drvećem za pantropsko područje u "
"razlučivosti od 10 m, izraženu kao postotak pokrova drvećem. Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover/"
"tree-cover-density-2020-raster-10-m-pantropical-annual)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis classifies pixels in Global freshwater bodies into 1) "
"Snow-covered ice, 2) Partially snow-covered or snow-free ice, 3) Open "
"water, and 4) Cloud. The data is updated in near-real time with the spatial "
"resolution of 500 m and with a temporal extent from July 2025 to present. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"global-500m_v2)."
msgstr ""
"Svakodnevno klasificira piksele u globalnim slatkovodnim tijelima u 1) led "
"prekriven snijegom, 2) led djelomično prekriven snijegom ili bez snijega, "
"3) otvorenu vodu i 4) oblak. Podaci se ažuriraju gotovo u stvarnom vremenu "
"u prostornoj razlučivosti od 500 m i s vremenskim obuhvatom od srpnja 2025. "
"do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"global-500m_v2)."

msgid ""
"Provides daily updates on the moisture conditions in different soil layers. "
"The data are available over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from 2007 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-12-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža dnevna ažuriranja uvjeta vlažnosti u različitim slojevima tla. Podaci "
"su dostupni za cijeli globus u prostornoj razlučivosti od 0,1° i s "
"vremenskim obuhvatom od 2007. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-12-5km)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the moisture condition at various depths in the soil. Daily "
"observations are available for the continental Europe in the spatial "
"resolution of 1 km and with the temporal extent from July 2025 to present. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Kvantificira stanje vlažnosti na različitim dubinama u tlu. Dnevna opažanja "
"dostupna su za kontinentalnu Europu u prostornoj razlučivosti od 1 km i s "
"vremenskim obuhvatom od srpnja 2025. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-1km)."

msgid ""
"Averages the daily Soil Water Index product over 10 days. The data are "
"produced every 10 days over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."
msgstr ""
"Usrednjava dnevni proizvod indeksa vode u tlu tijekom 10 dana. Podaci se "
"proizvode svakih 10 dana za cijeli globus u prostornoj razlučivosti od 0,1° "
"i s vremenskim obuhvatom od siječnja 2007. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."

msgid ""
"On daily basis for the Northern Europe classifies, in pixels, "
"inland/freshwater bodies as 1) Fully snow-covered ice, 2) Partially "
"snow-covered or snow-free ice, 3) Open water. The data is available in near "
"real time in the spatial resolution of 250 m and with the temporal extent "
"from March 2017 to 30 June 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"baltic-v1-250m)."
msgstr ""
"Svakodnevno za Sjevernu Europu klasificira, po pikselima, "
"kopnena/slatkovodna tijela u 1) led potpuno prekriven snijegom, 2) led "
"djelomično prekriven snijegom ili bez snijega, 3) otvorenu vodu. Podaci su "
"dostupni gotovo u stvarnom vremenu u prostornoj razlučivosti od 250 m i s "
"vremenskim obuhvatom od ožujka 2017. do 30. lipnja 2024. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"baltic-v1-250m)."

msgid ""
"Provides actual evapotranspiration, soil evaporation and canopy "
"transpiration with some quality indicators. Estimates are provided for two "
"evapotranspiration schemes and an Ensemble of models. Every 10-days "
"estimate are available in near real time at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of about 300 m from November 2025 onwards in version 1.0. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/"
"evapotranspiration-2025-present-raster-300m-global-10-daily-version-1)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža stvarnu evapotranspiraciju, isparavanje iz tla i transpiraciju "
"krošnje s nekim pokazateljima kvalitete. Procjene se daju za dvije sheme "
"evapotranspiracije i ansambl modela. Procjene svakih 10 dana dostupne su "
"gotovo u stvarnom vremenu na globalnoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od "
"oko 300 m od studenoga 2025. nadalje u verziji 1.0. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/"
"evapotranspiration-2025-present-raster-300m-global-10-daily-version-1)."

msgid ""
"Provides latent and sensible heat fluxes with one auxiliary information. "
"Estimates are provided for each Sentinel-3 overpass in near real time at "
"global scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from November 2025 "
"onwards in version 1.0. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/heat-flux-2"
"025-present-raster-300-m-global-daily-version-1)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža tokove latentne i osjetne topline s jednom pomoćnom informacijom. "
"Procjene se daju za svaki prelet Sentinela-3 gotovo u stvarnom vremenu na "
"globalnoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od oko 300 m od studenoga 2025. "
"nadalje u verziji 1.0. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/heat-flux-"
"2025-present-raster-300-m-global-daily-version-1)."

msgid ""
"Provides the temperature of the water at the lake surface. The LSWT "
"observations (every 10 days) are available at global scale at spatial "
"resolution of ~1 km and with the temporal extent from 2002 to 2012. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-offline-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža temperaturu vode na površini jezera. Opažanja LSWT-a (svakih 10 dana) "
"dostupna su na globalnoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od ~1 km i s "
"vremenskim obuhvatom od 2002. do 2012. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-offline-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides the temperature of the water at the lake surface. The near real "
"time observations (every 10 days) are available at global scale at spatial "
"resolution of ~1 km and with the temporal extent from 2016 to present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-near-real-time-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža temperaturu vode na površini jezera. Opažanja gotovo u stvarnom "
"vremenu (svakih 10 dana) dostupna su na globalnoj razini u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od ~1 km i s vremenskim obuhvatom od 2016. do danas. Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-near-real-time-v1-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in near real time at 100 m spatial resolution "
"from September 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v2-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža poluneprekidna opažanja za velik broj srednjih i velikih jezera, "
"prema Global Lakes and Wetlands Database (GLWD) ili inače od posebnog "
"interesa za praćenje okoliša. 10-dnevna opažanja dostupna su gotovo u "
"stvarnom vremenu u prostornoj razlučivosti od 100 m od rujna 2024. do "
"danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v2-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about Leaf Area Index, defined as half the total area "
"of green elements of the canopy per unit horizontal ground area. Every "
"10-days estimates are available at global scale in the spatial resolution "
"of ~300 m from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2-"
"0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža informacije o indeksu lisne površine, definiranom kao polovica ukupne "
"površine zelenih elemenata krošnje po jedinici vodoravne površine tla. "
"Procjene svakih 10 dana dostupne su na globalnoj razini u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od ~300 m od siječnja 2014. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2"
"-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the fraction of the solar radiation absorbed by live plants for "
"photosynthesis. Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale, in "
"the spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Kvantificira udio sunčeva zračenja koje žive biljke apsorbiraju za "
"fotosintezu. Procjene svakih 10 dana dostupne su na globalnoj razini, u "
"prostornoj razlučivosti od ~300 m, od siječnja 2014. do danas. Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information of the fraction of ground covered by green vegetation. "
"Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of ~ 300 m from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-green-"
"vegetation-cover-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža informacije o udjelu tla prekrivenog zelenom vegetacijom. Procjene "
"svakih 10 dana dostupne su na globalnoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od "
"~300 m od siječnja 2014. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-green-"
"vegetation-cover-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2018 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover data for 764 "
"Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the 2018 "
"reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans countries, as "
"well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2018 pruža pouzdane, međusobno "
"usporedive podatke visoke razlučivosti o pokrovu i namjeni zemljišta za 764 "
"funkcionalna urbana područja (FUA) s više od 50 000 stanovnika za "
"referentnu 2018. godinu u zemljama EEA38 (EU, EFTA, zemlje zapadnog Balkana "
"te Türkiye) i Ujedinjenoj Kraljevini. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2021 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover data for 790 "
"Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the 2021 "
"reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans countries, as "
"well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2021 pruža pouzdane, međusobno "
"usporedive podatke visoke razlučivosti o pokrovu i namjeni zemljišta za 790 "
"funkcionalnih urbanih područja (FUA) s više od 50 000 stanovnika za "
"referentnu 2021. godinu u zemljama EEA38 (EU, EFTA, zemlje zapadnog Balkana "
"te Türkiye) i Ujedinjenoj Kraljevini. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use Change 2018-2021 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover change data for "
"764 Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the "
"2021 reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans "
"countries, as well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use Change 2018-2021 pruža pouzdane, "
"međusobno usporedive podatke visoke razlučivosti o promjenama pokrova i "
"namjene zemljišta za 764 funkcionalna urbana područja (FUA) s više od 50 "
"000 stanovnika za referentnu 2021. godinu u zemljama EEA38 (EU, EFTA, "
"zemlje zapadnog Balkana te Türkiye) i Ujedinjenoj Kraljevini. Više "
"informacija [ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Street Tree Layer 2021 provides information about presence of "
"trees within Functional Urban Areas (FUA). More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Street Tree Layer 2021 pruža informacije o prisutnosti drveća "
"unutar funkcionalnih urbanih područja (FUA). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Provides detailed land cover and land use information for 59 thematic "
"classes in selected Natura2000 and Emerald sites for the 2021 reference "
"year. The dataset has a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.5 ha and a Minimum "
"Mapping Width (MMW) of 10 m and is available as vector data. More "
"information [here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/n2k)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža detaljne informacije o pokrovu i namjeni zemljišta za 59 tematskih "
"klasa na odabranim lokacijama Natura2000 i Emerald za referentnu 2021. "
"godinu. Skup podataka ima minimalnu jedinicu kartiranja (MMU) od 0,5 ha i "
"minimalnu širinu kartiranja (MMW) od 10 m te je dostupan kao vektorski "
"podaci. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/n2k)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the overall growth rate, or net dry biomass "
"increase, of the vegetation. It is equivalent to Net Primary Production "
"(NPP) but expressed in kg of dry matter per hectare and per day. Every "
"10-days, estimates are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution "
"of ~300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža informacije o ukupnoj stopi rasta, odnosno neto povećanju suhe "
"biomase vegetacije. Ekvivalent je neto primarne produkcije (NPP) ali "
"izražen u kg suhe tvari po hektaru i danu. Procjene svakih 10 dana dostupne "
"su na globalnoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti od ~300 m, od siječnja "
"2014. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the total amount of carbon compounds produced by "
"photosynthesis of plants in an ecosystem in a given period of time, "
"expressed in gC/m²/day. Every 10-days, estimates are available at global "
"scale, at a spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the "
"present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža informacije o ukupnoj količini ugljikovih spojeva proizvedenih "
"fotosintezom biljaka u ekosustavu u zadanom vremenskom razdoblju, izraženoj "
"u gC/m²/dan. Procjene svakih 10 dana dostupne su na globalnoj razini, u "
"prostornoj razlučivosti od ~300 m, od siječnja 2014. do danas. Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the net amount of biomass, or carbon, produced "
"by plants per unit area and time, expressed in gC/m²/day. It is equal to "
"the difference between the Gross Primary Production (GPP), i.e. the total "
"amount of carbon produced through photosynthesis, and the amount of energy "
"used for plant respiration. Every 10-days, estimates are available at "
"global scale, at a spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the "
"present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža informacije o neto količini biomase, odnosno ugljika, koju biljke "
"proizvedu po jedinici površine i vremena, izraženoj u gC/m²/dan. Jednaka je "
"razlici između bruto primarne produkcije (GPP), tj. ukupne količine ugljika "
"proizvedenog fotosintezom, i količine energije utrošene za disanje biljaka. "
"Procjene svakih 10 dana dostupne su na globalnoj razini, u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od ~300 m, od siječnja 2014. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the total amount of dry matter produced by land "
"plants per unit time through photosynthesis. It is equivalent to Gross "
"Primary Production (GPP) but expressed in kg of dry matter per hectare and "
"per day. Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale, at a "
"spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža informacije o ukupnoj količini suhe tvari koju kopnene biljke "
"proizvedu po jedinici vremena fotosintezom. Ekvivalent je bruto primarne "
"produkcije (GPP) ali izražen u kg suhe tvari po hektaru i danu. Procjene "
"svakih 10 dana dostupne su na globalnoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti "
"od ~300 m, od siječnja 2014. do danas. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Dominant Leaf Type (DLT) raster product provides a "
"basic land cover classification with 3 thematic classes (all non-tree "
"covered areas, broadleaved and coniferous).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for "
"the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)"
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Dominant Leaf Type (DLT) pruža osnovnu "
"klasifikaciju pokrova zemljišta s 3 tematske klase (sva područja bez "
"drveća, bjelogorica i crnogorica).\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2018. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest dio je usluge "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka "
"dostupan je sloj pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land Presence (CPFLP) "
"raster product provides the yearly fallow land classification indicating if "
"arable land has been left fallow in the respective calendar year. This "
"dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries. High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the "
"European Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer "
"available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land "
"Presence (CPFLP) pruža godišnju klasifikaciju ugara koja pokazuje je li "
"obradivo zemljište ostavljeno na ugaru u dotičnoj kalendarskoj godini. Ovaj "
"skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 metara "
"(potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x 100 km "
"koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38. Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio "
"je usluge Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup "
"podataka dostupan je sloj pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil After (CPBSA) "
"raster product provides bare soil period (in days) after the harvest of the "
"main annual crop. Note that the bare soil period cannot transcend the "
"calendar year for which the product is generated.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil "
"After (CPBSA) pruža razdoblje golog tla (u danima) nakon žetve glavne "
"jednogodišnje kulture. Imajte na umu da razdoblje golog tla ne može "
"prelaziti kalendarsku godinu za koju se proizvod generira.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land Duration (CPFLD) "
"raster product provides information on the duration of fallow land periods, "
"expressed in days, over a five-year period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"Note: each product covers a five-year window and is referenced by the end "
"year of that window (e.g. the 2021 product covers the period 2017–2021).\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land "
"Duration (CPFLD) pruža informacije o trajanju razdoblja ugara, izraženom u "
"danima, tijekom petogodišnjeg razdoblja.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Napomena: svaki proizvod pokriva petogodišnje razdoblje i označava se "
"završnom godinom tog razdoblja (npr. proizvod za 2021. pokriva razdoblje "
"2017.–2021.).\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil Before (CPBSB) "
"raster product provides the bare soil period (in days) before the emergence "
"of the main annual crop. Note that the bare soil period cannot transcend "
"the calendar year for which the product is generated.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil "
"Before (CPBSB) pruža razdoblje golog tla (u danima) prije nicanja glavne "
"jednogodišnje kulture. Imajte na umu da razdoblje golog tla ne može "
"prelaziti kalendarsku godinu za koju se proizvod generira.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Dominant Leaf Type Change (DLTC) raster provides "
"information on the change between two reference years, and consists of 5 "
"thematic classes (new broadleaved cover / new coniferous cover / loss of "
"broadleaved cover / loss of coniferous cover / unchanged areas with tree "
"cover). This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 and "
"2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"The production of the high resolution forest layers was coordinated by the "
"European Environment Agency (EEA) in the frame of the EU Copernicus "
"programme.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Raster High Resolution Layer Dominant Leaf Type Change (DLTC) pruža "
"informacije o promjeni između dviju referentnih godina i sastoji se od 5 "
"tematskih klasa (novi pokrov bjelogorice / novi pokrov crnogorice / gubitak "
"pokrova bjelogorice / gubitak pokrova crnogorice / nepromijenjena područja "
"s pokrovom drvećem). Ovaj skup podataka pokriva dva razdoblja usporedbe, "
"2018.-2021. i 2021.-2024., a svaki proizvod datiran je završnom godinom "
"razdoblja usporedbe.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se u rasterima od 20 metara (potpuno usklađenima s "
"referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x 100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje "
"EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvodnju visokorazlučivih slojeva šuma koordinirala je Europska agencija "
"za okoliš (EEA) u okviru programa EU-a Copernicus.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Crop Types (CTY) raster product provides high "
"resolution crop type classification for 17 classes of both arable and "
"permanent crops across the EEA38 extent. Using both Sentinel-1 and "
"Sentinel-2, the model is finetuned to first map the crop field boundaries, "
"and then determine the main crop for each field.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Crop Types (CTY) pruža "
"klasifikaciju vrsta usjeva visoke razlučivosti za 17 klasa obradivih i "
"trajnih usjeva na području EEA38. Koristeći Sentinel-1 i Sentinel-2, model "
"je fino podešen da najprije kartira granice poljoprivrednih parcela, a "
"zatim odredi glavni usjev za svaku parcelu.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Duration (CPMCD) "
"raster product provides the duration (in days) of the growing season for "
"the main (annual) crop.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries. High Resolution Layer Croplands product is "
"part of the European Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence "
"layer available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop "
"Duration (CPMCD) pruža trajanje (u danima) vegetacijske sezone glavnog "
"(jednogodišnjeg) usjeva.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38. Proizvod High Resolution Layer "
"Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Europske unije. "
"Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The Copernicus High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Presence Change (TCPC) "
"raster product provides information on the change between two reference "
"years, and consists of 3 thematic classes (new tree cover / loss of tree "
"cover / unchanged areas with tree cover). The class 255 = outside area is "
"predefined by the 100m boundary layer and remains unchanged. This layer for "
"previous reference year comparisons is called Tree Cover Change Mask "
"(TCCM). This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 and "
"2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"The production of the high resolution forest layers was coordinated by the "
"European Environment Agency (EEA) in the frame of the EU Copernicus "
"programme. Confidence layer available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod Copernicus High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Presence "
"Change (TCPC) pruža informacije o promjeni između dviju referentnih godina "
"i sastoji se od 3 tematske klase (novi pokrov drvećem / gubitak pokrova "
"drvećem / nepromijenjena područja s pokrovom drvećem). Klasa 255 = područje "
"izvan obuhvata unaprijed je definirana slojem granica od 100 m i ostaje "
"nepromijenjena. Ovaj sloj za usporedbe prethodnih referentnih godina naziva "
"se Tree Cover Change Mask (TCCM). Ovaj skup podataka pokriva dva razdoblja "
"usporedbe, 2018.-2021. i 2021.-2024., a svaki proizvod datiran je završnom "
"godinom razdoblja usporedbe.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se u rasterima od 20 metara (potpuno usklađenima s "
"referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x 100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje "
"EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvodnju visokorazlučivih slojeva šuma koordinirala je Europska agencija "
"za okoliš (EEA) u okviru programa EU-a Copernicus. Za skup podataka "
"dostupan je sloj pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Change (GRAC) raster product at 20m "
"resolution provides information on changes in grassland vegetation cover. "
"The thematic classes indicate all non-grassland areas, grassland gain and "
"grassland loss, unchanged grassland in both years and unverified grassland "
"gain and loss areas. This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 "
"and 2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Grassland Change (GRAC) "
"razlučivosti 20 m pruža informacije o promjenama vegetacijskog pokrova "
"travnjaka. Tematske klase označavaju sva područja bez travnjaka, dobitak i "
"gubitak travnjaka, travnjake nepromijenjene u obje godine te neprovjerena "
"područja dobitka i gubitka travnjaka. Ovaj skup podataka pokriva dva "
"razdoblja usporedbe, 2018.-2021. i 2021.-2024., a svaki proizvod datiran je "
"završnom godinom razdoblja usporedbe.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se u rasterima od 20 metara (potpuno usklađenima s "
"referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x 100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje "
"EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Grasslands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) provides a forest "
"classification with 3 thematic classes (all non-forest areas / broadleaved "
"forest / coniferous forest) at 10m spatial resolution and with a Minimum "
"Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.5 ha. This raster layer is largely following the "
"FAO (Food and Agriculture Organisation of the United Nations) forest "
"definition with tree covered areas in agricultural and urban context "
"excluded using the respective Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)"
msgstr ""
"High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) pruža klasifikaciju šuma s 3 "
"tematske klase (sva područja bez šume / bjelogorična šuma / crnogorična "
"šuma) u prostornoj razlučivosti od 10 m i s minimalnom jedinicom kartiranja "
"(MMU) od 0,5 ha. Ovaj rasterski sloj uglavnom slijedi definiciju šume FAO-a "
"(Organizacija za hranu i poljoprivredu Ujedinjenih naroda), pri čemu su "
"područja prekrivena drvećem u poljoprivrednom i urbanom kontekstu "
"isključena pomoću odgovarajućeg sloja Forest Additional Support Layer "
"(FADSL).\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se s trogodišnjom učestalošću u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest dio je usluge "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Europske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) raster product provides a binary "
"status layer of grassland/non-grassland mask. This grassy and non-woody "
"vegetation baseline product includes all kinds of grasslands: managed "
"grassland, semi-natural grassland and natural grassy vegetation. It does "
"not include temporary grasslands, which are masked out using the "
"corresponding Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH), indicating on the number of "
"years since a pixel was last ploughed.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) pruža binarni "
"statusni sloj maske travnjak/ne-travnjak. Ovaj osnovni proizvod travnate i "
"neodrvenjene vegetacije uključuje sve vrste travnjaka: gospodarene "
"travnjake, poluprirodne travnjake i prirodnu travnatu vegetaciju. Ne "
"uključuje privremene travnjake, koji se maskiraju pomoću odgovarajućeg "
"pokazatelja oranja (PLOUGH), koji pokazuje broj godina otkad je piksel "
"posljednji put preoran.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Grasslands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) dataset provides "
"information on the proportional crown coverage per pixel at 10 meter "
"spatial resolution and ranges from 0% (all non-tree covered areas) to 100%, "
"whereby Tree Cover Density is defined as the \"vertical projection of tree "
"crowns to a horizontal earth’s surface\".\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for "
"the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)."
msgstr ""
"Skup podataka High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) pruža "
"informacije o proporcionalnoj pokrivenosti krošnjama po pikselu u "
"prostornoj razlučivosti od 10 metara i kreće se od 0 % (sva područja bez "
"drveća) do 100 %, pri čemu je gustoća pokrova drvećem definirana kao "
"„okomita projekcija krošanja drveća na vodoravnu površinu Zemlje”.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2018. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest dio je usluge "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka "
"dostupan je sloj pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH) raster product "
"continues the 2015 and 2018 PLOUGH Layer following a rolling archive "
"principle by adding current information and removing historic years. It "
"indicates the number of years since the last indication of ploughing within "
"the permanent grassland area. PLOUGH is derived by taking into account the "
"series of binary HER layers, the BVL classifications and HR VPP PPI (Plant "
"Phenology Index) quantiles. BVL classes 4 (crop) and 7 (overlaying layer "
"between herbaceous and crop) indicate a ploughing event. Low HR VPP PPI "
"quantiles indicate low vegetation at a certain time of the year. For years "
"with missing information (2016 and earlier) the ploughing information from "
"the historic PLOUGH product is considered which causes some issues.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH) "
"nastavlja slojeve PLOUGH iz 2015. i 2018. prema načelu pomičnog arhiva "
"dodavanjem aktualnih informacija i uklanjanjem povijesnih godina. Pokazuje "
"broj godina od posljednjeg pokazatelja oranja unutar područja trajnih "
"travnjaka. PLOUGH se izvodi uzimanjem u obzir niza binarnih HER slojeva, "
"klasifikacija BVL i kvantila HR VPP PPI (Plant Phenology Index). Klase BVL "
"4 (usjev) i 7 (preklapajući sloj između zeljastog i usjeva) označavaju "
"događaj oranja. Niski kvantili HR VPP PPI označavaju nisku vegetaciju u "
"određeno doba godine. Za godine s nedostajućim informacijama (2016. i "
"ranije) uzimaju se informacije o oranju iz povijesnog proizvoda PLOUGH, što "
"uzrokuje neke probleme.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Grasslands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Building Block Height 2021 is a 10 m high resolution raster "
"layer containing height information generated for selected cities and urban "
"areas as part of the Urban atlas suite of products. Height information is "
"based on satellite information and derived datasets like the digital "
"surface model, the digital terrain model and the normalized digital surface "
"model (DSM). More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Building Block Height 2021 je rasterski sloj visoke "
"razlučivosti od 10 m koji sadrži informacije o visini generirane za "
"odabrane gradove i urbana područja u sklopu paketa proizvoda Urban Atlas. "
"Informacije o visini temelje se na satelitskim informacijama i izvedenim "
"skupovima podataka poput digitalnog modela površine, digitalnog modela "
"terena i normaliziranog digitalnog modela površine (DSM). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Type (CPSCT) "
"raster product indicates if a cover crop was present within the respective "
"calendar year and further segregates the types of cover crop into: short "
"summer, long summer, short winter and long winter cover crop.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Type (CPSCT) pokazuje je li u dotičnoj kalendarskoj godini bio prisutan "
"pokrovni usjev i dodatno razvrstava vrste pokrovnih usjeva na: kratki "
"ljetni, dugi ljetni, kratki zimski i dugi zimski pokrovni usjev.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Dates (GRAMD) raster product "
"provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 10 m a basic "
"land cover classification, flagging and mapping the start date (DOY) "
"(GRAMD) within the detected Herbaceous cover layer (temporal and permanent "
"grassland)) with a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.25 ha. The GRAMD product "
"will flag and map the dates (Day of Year) of each mowing event on temporary "
"or permanent grassland per year, resulting in a product split in four "
"different rasters per year.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2017 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Dates (GRAMD) "
"pruža na paneuropskoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od 10 m osnovnu "
"klasifikaciju pokrova zemljišta, označavajući i kartirajući početni datum "
"(DOY) (GRAMD) unutar otkrivenog sloja zeljastog pokrova (privremeni i "
"trajni travnjaci) s minimalnom jedinicom kartiranja (MMU) od 0,25 ha. "
"Proizvod GRAMD označava i kartira datume (dan u godini) svakog događaja "
"košnje na privremenim ili trajnim travnjacima po godini, što rezultira "
"proizvodom podijeljenim na četiri različita rastera po godini.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Grasslands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons Types "
"(CPCSY) raster product provides the number of different crop types grown in "
"a 3-year period [0-3] (excluding cover crops).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping "
"Seasons Types (CPCSY) pruža broj različitih vrsta usjeva uzgojenih u "
"razdoblju od 3 godine [0-3] (isključujući pokrovne usjeve).\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Events (GRAME) raster product "
"provides a basic land cover classification containing respectively the "
"number of grassland mowing events within the detected Herbaceous cover "
"layer (temporal and permanent grassland) with a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) "
"of 0.25 ha. The GRAME product will flag and map the number of mowing events "
"(1, 2, 3, or 4+) on temporary or permanent grassland detected per year.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Events (GRAME) "
"pruža osnovnu klasifikaciju pokrova zemljišta koja sadrži broj događaja "
"košnje travnjaka unutar otkrivenog sloja zeljastog pokrova (privremeni i "
"trajni travnjaci) s minimalnom jedinicom kartiranja (MMU) od 0,25 ha. "
"Proizvod GRAME označava i kartira broj događaja košnje (1, 2, 3 ili 4+) na "
"privremenim ili trajnim travnjacima otkrivenih po godini.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Grasslands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Herbaceous cover (HER) raster product provides a "
"basic land cover classification with 2 thematic classes (temporal and "
"permanent herbaceous / non-herbaceous). The production of the herbaceous "
"layer is primarily based on the probability estimates obtained from the "
"Base Vegetation Layer (BVL) which also serves to harmonize the different "
"vegetated HRL products (Grasslands, Tree Cover and Forests, Croplands). HER "
"is further used as input for the Grassland status layer (GRA) extracting "
"the permanent herbaceous in combination with the Ploughing indicator "
"(PLOUGH).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Herbaceous cover (HER) pruža "
"osnovnu klasifikaciju pokrova zemljišta s 2 tematske klase (privremeno i "
"trajno zeljasto / nezeljasto). Izrada zeljastog sloja prvenstveno se "
"temelji na procjenama vjerojatnosti dobivenima iz sloja Base Vegetation "
"Layer (BVL), koji služi i za usklađivanje različitih vegetacijskih HRL "
"proizvoda (Grasslands, Tree Cover and Forests, Croplands). HER se dalje "
"koristi kao ulaz za statusni sloj travnjaka (GRA) izdvajanjem trajnog "
"zeljastog pokrova u kombinaciji s pokazateljem oranja (PLOUGH).\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Grasslands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons Yearly "
"(CPCSY) raster product provides number of growing seasons detected within 1 "
"year (0/1/2).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping "
"Seasons Yearly (CPCSY) pruža broj vegetacijskih sezona otkrivenih unutar 1 "
"godine (0/1/2).\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-synthesis-global-v3-0-3km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža procjene temperature površine kopna na globalnoj razini, u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od ~3 km. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/1"
"0daily-land-surface-temperature-synthesis-global-v3-0-3km)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-global-v3-0-3km)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža procjene temperature površine kopna na globalnoj razini, u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od ~3 km. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-global-v3-0-3km)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-"
"reflectance?tab=land_surface_temperature)."
msgstr ""
"Pruža procjene temperature površine kopna na globalnoj razini, u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od ~3 km. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-"
"reflectance?tab=land_surface_temperature)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Emergence "
"(CPSCE) raster product provides the date of emergence of the cover crop in "
"days of the year (DOY). YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the year (e.g. 19 "
"for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365)\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Emergence (CPSCE) pruža datum nicanja pokrovnog usjeva u danima u godini "
"(DOY). YYDOY gdje je YY = posljednje 2 znamenke godine (npr. 19 za 2019.), "
"a DOY je dan u godini (1-365)\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) provides "
"information on trees under agricultural use or in urban context to be "
"excluded from the Forest Type (FTY) product and at 10m spatial resolution. "
"The derivation of Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) is based on the "
"spatial intersection of the 10m DLT and TCD layers with CORINE Land Cover "
"(CLC) 2018 and HRL Imperviousness Degree 2018 with 10 m spatial resolution; "
"TCD range of 10-100%; with a MMW of 10m and no MMU (pixel base).\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries.\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"High Resolution Layer Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) pruža "
"informacije o drveću pod poljoprivrednom uporabom ili u urbanom kontekstu "
"koje treba isključiti iz proizvoda Forest Type (FTY), u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od 10 m. Izvođenje sloja Forest Additional Support Layer "
"(FADSL) temelji se na prostornom presjeku slojeva DLT i TCD od 10 m s "
"CORINE Land Cover (CLC) 2018 i HRL Imperviousness Degree 2018 prostorne "
"razlučivosti 10 m; raspon TCD-a 10-100 %; s MMW-om od 10 m i bez MMU-a (na "
"razini piksela).\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se s trogodišnjom učestalošću u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest dio je usluge "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Europske unije.\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Duration "
"(CPSCD) raster product provides the duration (in days) of the cover crop "
"season (can exceed the calendar year).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Duration (CPSCD) pruža trajanje (u danima) sezone pokrovnog usjeva (može "
"premašiti kalendarsku godinu).\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The Cloud Classification (CC) product provides information on the extent of "
"clouds and cloud shadows derived from optical satellite data acquired by "
"the **Sentinel-2** constellation. Cloud detection is performed at a "
"**120m** spatial resolution using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a pixel spacing of 20 m "
"x 20 m. It used to produce the CLMS High-Resolution Water, Snow and Ice "
"datasets (HR-WSI), which rely on Sentinel-2 imagery.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. No product is generated for a "
"Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds 90%.<br><br>More information in "
"the products documentation "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod Cloud Classification (CC) pruža informacije o opsegu oblaka i "
"sjena oblaka dobivene iz optičkih satelitskih podataka koje prikuplja "
"konstelacija **Sentinel-2**. Detekcija oblaka provodi se u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od **120 m** pomoću [softvera "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Generira se "
"gotovo u stvarnom vremenu na europskoj razini, s razmakom piksela od 20 m x "
"20 m. Koristi se za izradu CLMS skupova podataka High-Resolution Water, "
"Snow and Ice (HR-WSI), koji se oslanjaju na snimke "
"Sentinel-2.<br><br>**Dostupnost podataka**: od 2016. do danas. Za pločicu "
"Sentinel-2 ne generira se proizvod kada naoblaka premašuje 90 "
"%.<br><br>Više informacija u dokumentaciji proizvoda "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The **Fractional Snow Cover (FSC)** product provides the fraction of the "
"surface covered by snow at the top of canopy (FSC-TOC) and on ground "
"(FSC-OG) per pixel as a percentage (0% – 100%). Cloud detection in the "
"Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale based on optical satellite "
"data from the **Sentinel-2** constellation, with a spatial resolution of "
"**20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No "
"product is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod **Fractional Snow Cover (FSC)** pruža udio površine prekrivene "
"snijegom na vrhu krošnje (FSC-TOC) i na tlu (FSC-OG) po pikselu u postocima "
"(0 % – 100 %). Detekcija oblaka na snimkama Sentinel-2 provodi se pomoću "
"[softvera "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Generira se "
"gotovo u stvarnom vremenu na europskoj razini na temelju optičkih "
"satelitskih podataka konstelacije **Sentinel-2**, u prostornoj razlučivosti "
"od **20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Dostupnost podataka**: od 2016. do danas. Za "
"pločicu Sentinel-2 ne generira se proizvod kada naoblaka premašuje 90 "
"%.<br><br>Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The **SAR Wet Snow (SWS)** product provides the wet snow extent for high "
"mountain areas, based on C-band Synthetic Aperture Radar satellite data "
"from the **Sentinel-1** constellation.<br><br>It is generated in near "
"real-time for selected high mountain areas at European scale with a spatial "
"resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to "
"the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-sar-wet-"
"snow)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod **SAR Wet Snow (SWS)** pruža opseg mokrog snijega za visokogorska "
"područja, na temelju satelitskih podataka radara sa sintetičkim otvorom "
"C-pojasa konstelacije **Sentinel-1**.<br><br>Generira se gotovo u stvarnom "
"vremenu za odabrana visokogorska područja na europskoj razini u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Dostupnost podataka**: od 2016. "
"do danas.<br><br>Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-sar-wet-"
"snow)."

msgid ""
"The **Wet / Dry Snow (WDS)** product provides information on the snow state "
"(wet or dry) by combining **Sentinel-1** radar-based wet snow maps within "
"the snow cover extent derived from **Sentinel-2** optical data. Cloud "
"detection in the Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a spatial resolution of "
"**60 m x 60 m** in areas where Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 observation tracks "
"overlap.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No product "
"is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-wet-dry-"
"snow)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod **Wet / Dry Snow (WDS)** pruža informacije o stanju snijega (mokar "
"ili suh) kombiniranjem radarskih karata mokrog snijega **Sentinel-1** "
"unutar opsega snježnog pokrova dobivenog iz optičkih podataka "
"**Sentinel-2**. Detekcija oblaka na snimkama Sentinel-2 provodi se pomoću "
"[softvera "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Generira se "
"gotovo u stvarnom vremenu na europskoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti od "
"**60 m x 60 m** na područjima gdje se preklapaju putanje opažanja "
"Sentinel-1 i Sentinel-2.<br><br>**Dostupnost podataka**: od 2016. do danas. "
"Za pločicu Sentinel-2 ne generira se proizvod kada naoblaka premašuje 90 "
"%.<br><br>Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-wet-dry-"
"snow)."

msgid ""
"The daily cumulative **Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover (GFSC)** product "
"provides pixel-wise snow cover extent as a percentage (0% – 100%). It is "
"based on synthetic aperture radar (SAR) data from the **Sentinel-1** "
"constellation and optical imagery from the **Sentinel-2** constellation. "
"The product is generated by merging all available Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 "
"observations acquired over the previous **seven days** to produce a "
"spatially complete composite of snow conditions, thereby reducing data gaps "
"caused by cloud cover and sensor coverage limitations. Snow information "
"derived from Sentinel-1 is focused on the detection of wet snow in "
"high-mountain areas.<br><br>It is generated on a daily basis at European "
"scale, with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-gap-"
"filled-fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Dnevni kumulativni proizvod **Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover (GFSC)** "
"pruža opseg snježnog pokrova po pikselu u postocima (0 % – 100 %). Temelji "
"se na podacima radara sa sintetičkim otvorom (SAR) konstelacije "
"**Sentinel-1** i optičkim snimkama konstelacije **Sentinel-2**. Proizvod se "
"generira spajanjem svih dostupnih opažanja Sentinel-1 i Sentinel-2 "
"prikupljenih tijekom prethodnih **sedam dana** radi izrade prostorno "
"potpunog kompozita stanja snijega, čime se smanjuju praznine u podacima "
"uzrokovane naoblakom i ograničenjima pokrivenosti senzora. Informacije o "
"snijegu dobivene iz Sentinela-1 usmjerene su na otkrivanje mokrog snijega u "
"visokogorskim područjima.<br><br>Generira se svakodnevno na europskoj "
"razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti od **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Dostupnost "
"podataka**: od 2016. do danas.<br><br>Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-gap-"
"filled-fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S2)** product characterizes the timing "
"and duration of the snow season. For each pixel and for a given "
"hydrological year, it provides the number of days with snow cover, as well "
"as the first and last day of the longest continuous snow period. The "
"hydrological year starts on 1 September.<br><br>The product is generated at "
"the European scale with a spatial resolution of **20 m x 20 m**, consistent "
"with the input snow cover maps derived from optical satellite data acquired "
"by the Sentinel-2 constellation (Fractional Snow Cover - "
"FSC).<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can "
"be downloaded in multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S2)** opisuje vrijeme i trajanje "
"snježne sezone. Za svaki piksel i određenu hidrološku godinu pruža broj "
"dana sa snježnim pokrovom te prvi i posljednji dan najdužeg neprekinutog "
"snježnog razdoblja. Hidrološka godina počinje 1. rujna.<br><br>Proizvod se "
"generira na europskoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od **20 m x 20 m**, "
"u skladu s ulaznim kartama snježnog pokrova dobivenima iz optičkih "
"satelitskih podataka konstelacije Sentinel-2 (Fractional Snow Cover - "
"FSC).<br><br>**Dostupnost podataka**: od 2016. do danas. Podaci se mogu "
"preuzeti u više projekcija i razmaka piksela.<br><br>Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."

msgid ""
"The Sentinel-1 & Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S1+S2)** product "
"characterizes the timing and duration of the snow season. For each pixel "
"and for a given hydrological year, it provides the number of days with snow "
"cover, as well as the first and last day of the longest continuous snow "
"period. The hydrological year starts on 1 September.<br><br>The product is "
"generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 "
"m**, consistent with the input snow cover maps derived from optical "
"satellite data acquired by the Sentinel-2 constellation and from C-band "
"Synthetic Aperture Radar satellite data acquired by the Sentinel-1 "
"constellation (Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover - GFSC).<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod Sentinel-1 & Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S1+S2)** opisuje "
"vrijeme i trajanje snježne sezone. Za svaki piksel i određenu hidrološku "
"godinu pruža broj dana sa snježnim pokrovom te prvi i posljednji dan "
"najdužeg neprekinutog snježnog razdoblja. Hidrološka godina počinje 1. "
"rujna.<br><br>Proizvod se generira na europskoj razini u prostornoj "
"razlučivosti od **60 m x 60 m**, u skladu s ulaznim kartama snježnog "
"pokrova dobivenima iz optičkih satelitskih podataka konstelacije Sentinel-2 "
"i iz satelitskih podataka radara sa sintetičkim otvorom C-pojasa "
"konstelacije Sentinel-1 (Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover - "
"GFSC).<br><br>**Dostupnost podataka**: od 2016. do danas. Podaci se mogu "
"preuzeti u više projekcija i razmaka piksela.<br><br>Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."

msgid ""
"The **Water Cover Duration (WCD)** product estimates the number of days "
"land is covered by water. For each pixel and for a given hydrological year, "
"it indicates how frequently water is present. The hydrological year starts "
"on 1 September. It is based on water masks derived from **Sentinel-1** "
"radar and **Sentinel-2** optical data, combined with Water/Ice Cover data "
"from Sentinel-2 (WIC S2).<br><br>The product is generated at the European "
"scale with a spatial resolution of **10 m x 10 m**.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-cover-duration)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod **Water Cover Duration (WCD)** procjenjuje broj dana tijekom kojih "
"je kopno prekriveno vodom. Za svaki piksel i određenu hidrološku godinu "
"pokazuje koliko je često voda prisutna. Hidrološka godina počinje 1. rujna. "
"Temelji se na maskama vode dobivenima iz radara **Sentinel-1** i optičkih "
"podataka **Sentinel-2**, u kombinaciji s podacima Water/Ice Cover iz "
"Sentinela-2 (WIC S2).<br><br>Proizvod se generira na europskoj razini u "
"prostornoj razlučivosti od **10 m x 10 m**.<br><br>**Dostupnost podataka**: "
"od 2016. do danas. Podaci se mogu preuzeti u više projekcija i razmaka "
"piksela.<br><br>Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-cover-duration)."

msgid ""
"The **Ice Cover Duration (ICD)** product describes how long inland waters "
"are covered by ice. For each pixel and for a given hydrological year, it "
"provides the number of days with ice cover. The hydrological year starts on "
"1 September. It is based on ice cover maps derived from **Sentinel-2** "
"optical data (Water/Ice Cover WIC S2) and **Sentinel-1** C-band Synthetic "
"Aperture Radar data (Water/Ice Cover WIC S1).<br><br>The product is "
"generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can "
"be downloaded in multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"ice-cover-duration)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod **Ice Cover Duration (ICD)** opisuje koliko dugo su kopnene vode "
"prekrivene ledom. Za svaki piksel i određenu hidrološku godinu pruža broj "
"dana s ledenim pokrovom. Hidrološka godina počinje 1. rujna. Temelji se na "
"kartama ledenog pokrova dobivenima iz optičkih podataka **Sentinel-2** "
"(Water/Ice Cover WIC S2) i podataka radara sa sintetičkim otvorom C-pojasa "
"**Sentinel-1** (Water/Ice Cover WIC S1).<br><br>Proizvod se generira na "
"europskoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Dostupnost podataka**: od 2016. do danas. Podaci se mogu "
"preuzeti u više projekcija i razmaka piksela.<br><br>Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"ice-cover-duration)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 (WICS1)** product provides "
"information about river and lake areas covered by snow-covered or snow-free "
"ice. It is based on synthetic aperture radar data from the **Sentinel-1** "
"constellation.<br><br>It is generated in near real-time at European scale, "
"with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: "
"from 2016 to the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 (WICS1)** pruža informacije o "
"područjima rijeka i jezera prekrivenima ledom prekrivenim snijegom ili "
"ledom bez snijega. Temelji se na podacima radara sa sintetičkim otvorom "
"konstelacije **Sentinel-1**.<br><br>Generira se gotovo u stvarnom vremenu "
"na europskoj razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti od **60 m x 60 "
"m**.<br><br>**Dostupnost podataka**: od 2016. do danas.<br><br>Više "
"informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-2 (WICS2)** product provides the "
"water and ice extent over land. A water mask is used to differentiate "
"between snow on ice-covered water areas and snow on land. Cloud detection "
"in the Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale based on optical satellite "
"data from the Sentinel-2 constellation, with a spatial resolution of **20 m "
"x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No "
"product is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-2 (WICS2)** pruža opseg vode i "
"leda nad kopnom. Maska vode koristi se za razlikovanje snijega na vodenim "
"površinama prekrivenima ledom i snijega na kopnu. Detekcija oblaka na "
"snimkama Sentinel-2 provodi se pomoću [softvera "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Generira se "
"gotovo u stvarnom vremenu na europskoj razini na temelju optičkih "
"satelitskih podataka konstelacije Sentinel-2, u prostornoj razlučivosti od "
"**20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Dostupnost podataka**: od 2016. do danas. Za "
"pločicu Sentinel-2 ne generira se proizvod kada naoblaka premašuje 90 "
"%.<br><br>Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 (WIC S1+S2)** "
"product shows which river and lake areas are covered by ice, with or "
"without snow. It combines data from two types of instruments acquired on "
"the same day to increase coverage and reduce missing information. It uses "
"water/ice cover information derived from **Sentinel-2** optical images (WIC "
"S2), and from **Sentinel-1** radar data (WIC S1).<br><br>The product is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a spatial resolution of "
"**20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the "
"present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 (WIC S1+S2)** "
"pokazuje koja su područja rijeka i jezera prekrivena ledom, sa snijegom ili "
"bez njega. Kombinira podatke dviju vrsta instrumenata prikupljene istog "
"dana radi povećanja pokrivenosti i smanjenja nedostajućih informacija. "
"Koristi informacije o pokrovu vodom/ledom dobivene iz optičkih snimki "
"**Sentinel-2** (WIC S2) i iz radarskih podataka **Sentinel-1** (WIC "
"S1).<br><br>Proizvod se generira gotovo u stvarnom vremenu na europskoj "
"razini, u prostornoj razlučivosti od **20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Dostupnost "
"podataka**: od 2016. do danas.<br><br>Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Broadleaved Density (BCD) dataset provides "
"information on the percentage of broadleaved pixels at 100m spatial "
"resolution, and is derived through aggregation of the 10m DLT for the "
"respective reference year. Within each cell the number of broadleaved "
"pixels are counted and the percentages stored into in the 100m pixel of the "
"BCD. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer "
"and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Skup podataka High Resolution Layer Broadleaved Density (BCD) pruža "
"informacije o postotku piksela bjelogorice u prostornoj razlučivosti od 100 "
"m, a dobiva se agregacijom DLT-a od 10 m za dotičnu referentnu godinu. "
"Unutar svake ćelije broji se broj piksela bjelogorice, a postoci se "
"pohranjuju u piksel od 100 m sloja BCD. Klasa 255 = područje izvan obuhvata "
"unaprijed je definirana slojem granica od 100 m i ostaje nepromijenjena.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2018. u rasterima od 100 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest dio je usluge "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Europske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Coniferous Cover Density (CCD) dataset provides "
"information on the percentage of coniferous pixels at 100m spatial "
"resolution, and is derived through aggregation of the 10m DLT for the "
"respective reference year. Within each cell the number of coniferous pixels "
"are counted and the percentages stored into in the 100m pixel of the CCD. "
"The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer and "
"remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Skup podataka High Resolution Layer Coniferous Cover Density (CCD) pruža "
"informacije o postotku piksela crnogorice u prostornoj razlučivosti od 100 "
"m, a dobiva se agregacijom DLT-a od 10 m za dotičnu referentnu godinu. "
"Unutar svake ćelije broji se broj piksela crnogorice, a postoci se "
"pohranjuju u piksel od 100 m sloja CCD. Klasa 255 = područje izvan obuhvata "
"unaprijed je definirana slojem granica od 100 m i ostaje nepromijenjena.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2018. u rasterima od 100 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest dio je usluge "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Europske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) dataset provides the Forest "
"Type estimation at 100 meter spatial resolution. The number of broadleaved "
"and coniferous pixels are counted and the percentages stored in the 100m "
"cell. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer "
"and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Skup podataka High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) pruža procjenu vrste "
"šume u prostornoj razlučivosti od 100 metara. Broji se broj piksela "
"bjelogorice i crnogorice, a postoci se pohranjuju u ćeliju od 100 m. Klasa "
"255 = područje izvan obuhvata unaprijed je definirana slojem granica od 100 "
"m i ostaje nepromijenjena.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se s trogodišnjom učestalošću u rasterima od 100 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest dio je usluge "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Europske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) raster product provides a binary "
"status layer of grassland/non-grassland mask. This grassy and non-woody "
"vegetation baseline product includes all kinds of grasslands: managed "
"grassland, semi-natural grassland and natural grassy vegetation. It does "
"not include temporary grasslands, which are masked out using the "
"corresponding Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH), indicating on the number of "
"years since a pixel was last ploughed. In the 100 meter raster product, the "
"number of Grassland pixels are counted and the percentages stored in each "
"100 meter cell. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m "
"boundary layer and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) pruža binarni "
"statusni sloj maske travnjak/ne-travnjak. Ovaj osnovni proizvod travnate i "
"neodrvenjene vegetacije uključuje sve vrste travnjaka: gospodarene "
"travnjake, poluprirodne travnjake i prirodnu travnatu vegetaciju. Ne "
"uključuje privremene travnjake, koji se maskiraju pomoću odgovarajućeg "
"pokazatelja oranja (PLOUGH), koji pokazuje broj godina otkad je piksel "
"posljednji put preoran. U rasterskom proizvodu od 100 metara broji se broj "
"piksela travnjaka, a postoci se pohranjuju u svaku ćeliju od 100 metara. "
"Klasa 255 = područje izvan obuhvata unaprijed je definirana slojem granica "
"od 100 m i ostaje nepromijenjena.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 100 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Grasslands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) dataset provides "
"information on the proportional crown coverage per pixel at 100 meter "
"spatial resolution and ranges from 0% (all non-tree covered areas) to 100%, "
"whereby Tree Cover Density is defined as the \"vertical projection of tree "
"crowns to a horizontal earth's surface\". This product is an aggregation of "
"its corresponding high resolution dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Skup podataka High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) pruža "
"informacije o proporcionalnoj pokrivenosti krošnjama po pikselu u "
"prostornoj razlučivosti od 100 metara i kreće se od 0 % (sva područja bez "
"drveća) do 100 %, pri čemu je gustoća pokrova drvećem definirana kao "
"„okomita projekcija krošanja drveća na vodoravnu površinu Zemlje”. Ovaj "
"proizvod je agregacija odgovarajućeg skupa podataka visoke razlučivosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2018. u rasterima od 100 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest dio je usluge "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Europske unije. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Emergence (CPMCE) "
"raster product provides the emergence date of the main (annual) crop "
"expressed in DOY (day of year). YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the year "
"(e.g. 19 for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop "
"Emergence (CPMCE) pruža datum nicanja glavnog (jednogodišnjeg) usjeva "
"izražen kao DOY (dan u godini). YYDOY gdje je YY = posljednje 2 znamenke "
"godine (npr. 19 za 2019.), a DOY je dan u godini (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Harvest (CPMCH) "
"raster product provides the harvest date of the main (annual) crop "
"expressed in days of the year (DOY). The harvest is considered as the time "
"of removal of most of the biomass. YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the "
"year (e.g. 19 for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterski proizvod High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop "
"Harvest (CPMCH) pruža datum žetve glavnog (jednogodišnjeg) usjeva izražen u "
"danima u godini (DOY). Žetvom se smatra trenutak uklanjanja većine biomase. "
"YYDOY gdje je YY = posljednje 2 znamenke godine (npr. 19 za 2019.), a DOY "
"je dan u godini (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka pruža se godišnje počevši od 2017. u rasterima od 10 "
"metara (potpuno usklađenima s referentnom mrežom EEA) u pločicama od 100 x "
"100 km koje pokrivaju zemlje EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod High Resolution Layer Croplands dio je usluge Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service Europske unije. Za skup podataka dostupan je sloj "
"pouzdanosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj skup podataka uključuje podatke iz francuskih prekomorskih područja "
"(DOM-ovi). Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"This metadata refers to the CORINE Land Cover Plus Land Use, Land-Use "
"Change and Forestry Instance (CLCplus LULUCF Instance), an annually "
"updated, pan-European, spatially consistent and seamless geospatial proxy "
"for land use reporting under the LULUCF regulation. The product is "
"delivered as a single raster layer with a spatial resolution of 100 m, "
"derived from multiple pan-European Copernicus Land Monitoring Service "
"(CLMS) high resolution input datasets. The LULUCF Instance is available for "
"the reference years 2018, 2021, 2022 and 2023, with production moving to an "
"annual update cycle starting from the 2021 product. Each raster cell "
"represents a dominant LULUCF land-use class, assigned according to thematic "
"and spatial rulesets implemented during the extraction process. While each "
"pixel corresponds primarily to one of the six main LULUCF land use "
"categories - forest land, grassland, cropland, settlements, wetlands, and "
"other lands - the dataset further differentiates these categories into sub "
"classes, resulting in a total of 27 classes. This classification structure "
"supports greenhouse gas reporting and other applications within the LULUCF "
"sector by providing a harmonised and policy relevant representation of land "
"use across Europe. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/clcplus-lulucf-instance)."
msgstr ""
"Ovi metapodaci odnose se na CORINE Land Cover Plus Land Use, Land-Use "
"Change and Forestry Instance (CLCplus LULUCF Instance), godišnje ažurirani, "
"paneuropski, prostorno dosljedni i neprekinuti geoprostorni zamjenski sloj "
"za izvješćivanje o namjeni zemljišta prema Uredbi LULUCF. Proizvod se "
"isporučuje kao jedan rasterski sloj prostorne razlučivosti 100 m, izveden "
"iz više paneuropskih visokorazlučivih ulaznih skupova podataka usluge "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service (CLMS). LULUCF Instance dostupan je za "
"referentne godine 2018., 2021., 2022. i 2023., s prelaskom proizvodnje na "
"godišnji ciklus ažuriranja počevši od proizvoda za 2021. Svaka ćelija "
"rastera predstavlja dominantnu klasu namjene zemljišta LULUCF, dodijeljenu "
"prema tematskim i prostornim skupovima pravila primijenjenima tijekom "
"postupka izdvajanja. Iako svaki piksel prvenstveno odgovara jednoj od šest "
"glavnih kategorija namjene zemljišta LULUCF - šumsko zemljište, travnjak, "
"obradivo zemljište, naselja, močvare i ostala zemljišta - skup podataka "
"dodatno razlikuje te kategorije u potklase, što rezultira ukupno 27 klasa. "
"Ta struktura klasifikacije podupire izvješćivanje o stakleničkim plinovima "
"i druge primjene u sektoru LULUCF pružajući usklađen i politički relevantan "
"prikaz namjene zemljišta diljem Europe. Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/clcplus-lulucf-instance)."

msgid ""
"The **High Resolution Water Layer (HRWL)** product provides classified maps "
"showing permanent water, temporary water, dry areas, and sea water. It is a "
"multi-annual product, typically covering a **7-year period**, and is "
"updated every 3 years. It is based on the annual Water Cover Duration (WCD) "
"production, which combines water masks from **Sentinel-1** radar and "
"**Sentinel-2** optical imagery with Water/Ice Cover data from Sentinel-2 "
"(WIC S2).\n"
"\n"
"The product is generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of "
"**10 m × 10 m**.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: HRWL is available for the reference years 2021 and "
"2024, covering the periods **01/09/2016**–31/12/2021 and "
"**01/09/2018**–31/12/2024, respectively. The dataset can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.\n"
"\n"
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-layer)."
msgstr ""
"Proizvod **High Resolution Water Layer (HRWL)** pruža klasificirane karte "
"koje prikazuju trajnu vodu, privremenu vodu, suha područja i morsku vodu. "
"To je višegodišnji proizvod koji obično pokriva **razdoblje od 7 godina** i "
"ažurira se svake 3 godine. Temelji se na godišnjoj proizvodnji Water Cover "
"Duration (WCD), koja kombinira maske vode iz radara **Sentinel-1** i "
"optičkih snimki **Sentinel-2** s podacima Water/Ice Cover iz Sentinela-2 "
"(WIC S2).\n"
"\n"
"Proizvod se generira na europskoj razini u prostornoj razlučivosti od **10 "
"m × 10 m**.\n"
"\n"
"**Dostupnost podataka**: HRWL je dostupan za referentne godine 2021. i "
"2024., koje pokrivaju razdoblja **01/09/2016**–31/12/2021 odnosno "
"**01/09/2018**–31/12/2024. Skup podataka može se preuzeti u više projekcija "
"i razmaka piksela.\n"
"\n"
"Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-layer)."

msgid ""
"This dataset comprises one cloud-free Very High Resolution optical coverage "
"of 39 European States (EEA-39) including all islands of those countries "
"plus \n"
"the French Overseas Departments of French Guiana, Martinique, Guadeloupe, "
"Mayotte and Réunion but excluding French Overseas Territories for a total "
"coverage \n"
"of ~ 6 million square kilometres. The area of interest is extended by a 4 "
"km buffer over the sea and a 500 m buffer over countries bordering the "
"EEA-39 states. \n"
"More "
"[info](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions/collections-description/VHR-IMAGE-2018)."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj skup podataka obuhvaća jedno bezoblačno optičko pokrivanje vrlo visoke "
"razlučivosti 39 europskih država (EEA-39) uključujući sve otoke tih zemalja "
"te \n"
"francuske prekomorske departmane Francusku Gijanu, Martinique, Guadeloupe, "
"Mayotte i Réunion, ali isključujući francuska prekomorska područja, za "
"ukupnu pokrivenost \n"
"od ~ 6 milijuna četvornih kilometara. Područje od interesa prošireno je "
"međuprostorom od 4 km nad morem i 500 m nad zemljama koje graniče s "
"državama EEA-39. \n"
"Više "
"[informacija](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions/collections-description/VHR-IMAGE-2018)."

