msgid ""
"The collection holds Level-2 Land Surface Temperature (LST) products from "
"OroraTech’s\n"
"FOREST satellites, at 200 m ground sampling distance, over selected "
"European pilot sites.\n"
"Each product is a Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF giving the land surface "
"temperature, in Kelvin.\n"
"Daytime and night-time acquisitions from complementary orbits make the "
"collection suited to\n"
"studying the daily temperature cycle, urban heat islands, drought and "
"surface water stress."
msgstr ""
"Kolekcija sadrži proizvode razine 2 temperature površine kopna (LST) sa "
"satelita FOREST tvrtke OroraTech, \n"
"u razmaku uzorkovanja tla od 200 m, nad odabranim europskim "
"pilot-lokacijama.\n"
"Svaki proizvod je Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF koji daje temperaturu površine "
"kopna u kelvinima.\n"
"Dnevna i noćna snimanja iz komplementarnih orbita čine kolekciju prikladnom "
"za\n"
"proučavanje dnevnog temperaturnog ciklusa, urbanih toplinskih otoka, suše i "
"stresa površinske vode."

msgid ""
"This mosaic dataset, directly processed and delivered by the data provider, "
"comprises one cloud-free Very High Resolution optical coverage of 39 "
"European States (EEA-39) including all islands of those countries plus\n"
"the French Overseas Departments of French Guiana, Martinique, Guadeloupe, "
"Mayotte and Réunion but excluding French Overseas Territories. The area of\n"
"interest (~6 million square kilometres) is extended by a 4 km buffer over "
"the sea and a 500 m buffer over countries bordering the EEA-39 states.\n"
"More info "
"[here](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/optical-vhr-coverage-over-europe-"
"vhrimage2024)."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj skup podataka mozaika, koji je izravno obradio i isporučio pružatelj "
"podataka, obuhvaća jedno bezoblačno optičko pokrivanje vrlo visoke "
"razlučivosti 39 europskih država (EEA-39) uključujući sve otoke tih zemalja "
"te\n"
"francuske prekomorske departmane Francusku Gijanu, Martinique, Guadeloupe, "
"Mayotte i Réunion, ali isključujući francuska prekomorska područja. "
"Područje od\n"
"interesa (~6 milijuna četvornih kilometara) prošireno je međuprostorom od 4 "
"km nad morem i 500 m nad zemljama koje graniče s državama EEA-39.\n"
"Više informacija "
"[ovdje](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/optical-vhr-coverage-over-europe-"
"vhrimage2024)."

msgid ""
"The Copernicus Contributing Missions (CCM) provide data that complements "
"the Copernicus Sentinel Missions and play a crucial role in Earth "
"observation.\n"
"These missions are conducted by ESA, its Member States, and international "
"third-party operators, and they offer very high to high resolution optical, "
"radar\n"
"and elevation model data. More "
"[info](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions)."
msgstr ""
"Copernicus Contributing Missions (CCM) pružaju podatke koji nadopunjuju "
"misije Copernicus Sentinel i imaju ključnu ulogu u promatranju Zemlje.\n"
"Te misije provode ESA, njezine države članice i međunarodni operateri "
"trećih strana, a nude optičke, radarske\n"
"podatke i podatke modela visina vrlo visoke do visoke razlučivosti. Više "
"[informacija](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions)."

